(73250, 2398, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting on this one... I wonder what lighting from the side would have looked like?  - jmsetzler</td>', 'Interesting lighting on this one... I wonder what lighting from the side would have looked like?  - jmsetzler', '2002-06-20 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
