(73281, 2405, 811, '<td valign="top">I know shadows are supposed to be dark, so please don''t think I''m an idiot, but the upper side of the picture is a little too dark for me, based on how bright the front is.  Were you using the camera''s flash?  If so, maybe cutting it off and using another light source (sometimes I''ve made a flashlight work okay) to keep from getting a blare right in front.</td>', 'I know shadows are supposed to be dark, so please don''t think I''m an idiot, but the upper side of the picture is a little too dark for me, based on how bright the front is.  Were you using the camera''s flash?  If so, maybe cutting it off and using another light source (sometimes I''ve made a flashlight work okay) to keep from getting a blare right in front.', '2002-06-19 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(73282, 2405, 1005, '<td valign="top">What shadow were you going for?  I see a crumb reflections in the table top, but ....no that couldn''t be it.  Help!  <br/>Photo 4 Creativity ?????  Shadows 2 total 3</td>', 'What shadow were you going for?  I see a crumb reflections in the table top, but ....no that couldn''t be it.  Help!  Photo 4 Creativity ?????  Shadows 2 total 3', '2002-06-19 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
