(73421, 2424, 1005, '<td valign="top">A beautiful piece.  Normally don''t like B&amp;W, but this would be an exception.  I like your background, the mat adds alot of interest.  What''s the chrome thingy?  Very cool.  Photo 10 Creativity 10 Shadows 10 total 10</td>', 'A beautiful piece.  Normally don''t like B&W, but this would be an exception.  I like your background, the mat adds alot of interest.  What''s the chrome thingy?  Very cool.  Photo 10 Creativity 10 Shadows 10 total 10', '2002-06-18 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
