(73434, 2424, 1, '<td valign="top">great shot, the object looks so small from the angle, but the shadow is huge.  i wouldnt have chosen that background...and if i didnt i wouldn''t have had it black and white. you just get lost in it, there''s not enough contrast.</td>', 'great shot, the object looks so small from the angle, but the shadow is huge.  i wouldnt have chosen that background...and if i didnt i wouldn''t have had it black and white. you just get lost in it, there''s not enough contrast.', '2002-06-22 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
