(73436, 2425, 2075, '<td valign="top">Somehow this feels fake to me. Even if she is looking towards the fire, she will more than likely see the shadow on the pages in her peripheral vision. I realize that this could be an instant in time before she notices the shadow, but then, I would have to suggest that there be "some" kind of motion, or reaction taking place in the image.</td>', 'Somehow this feels fake to me. Even if she is looking towards the fire, she will more than likely see the shadow on the pages in her peripheral vision. I realize that this could be an instant in time before she notices the shadow, but then, I would have to suggest that there be "some" kind of motion, or reaction taking place in the image.', '2002-06-17 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
