(73470, 2425, 1041, '<td valign="top">Eeek.  And all that while reading Patricia Cornwell no less.  Those books are violent enough even w/out threatening shadows!  It''s a great idea to incorporate the shadow into your picture.  Like the fire in the background, even though it is creating some hotspots, it does set the mood.</td>', 'Eeek.  And all that while reading Patricia Cornwell no less.  Those books are violent enough even w/out threatening shadows!  It''s a great idea to incorporate the shadow into your picture.  Like the fire in the background, even though it is creating some hotspots, it does set the mood.', '2002-06-22 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
