(73476, 2425, 573, '<td valign="top"><i>Is it cold where you are? it has been 90 degrees here all week :) - jmsetzler</i><br/><br/>85 - 90 degrees the evening this was shot plus real fire in fireplace and a 250 watt photo spot made life very uncomfortable for both of the models and the photographer.  The first sitting had camera motion blur, the second sitting cost me dearly in paybacks.<br/><br/><i>is that a pen?</i><br/>Actualy it is a paring knife, anything larger would have been to big because I wanted to maintain the sharpness of the shadow.<br/><br/>Thank you all for the comments.</td>', 'Is it cold where you are? it has been 90 degrees here all week :) - jmsetzler85 - 90 degrees the evening this was shot plus real fire in fireplace and a 250 watt photo spot made life very uncomfortable for both of the models and the photographer.  The first sitting had camera motion blur, the second sitting cost me dearly in paybacks.is that a pen?Actualy it is a paring knife, anything larger would have been to big because I wanted to maintain the sharpness of the shadow.Thank you all for the comments.', '2002-06-24 02:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
