(73678, 2445, 811, '<td valign="top">Voted on this before I found out it was yours.  Ha -- to all of the critics!!!  the colors fit this shot awsomely (is that a word?), and it is a very simple shot that makes you stop and think, "what does he mean with this picture?"   I think maybe if the hands were falling out of the frame I would like it more.</td>', 'Voted on this before I found out it was yours.  Ha -- to all of the critics!!!  the colors fit this shot awsomely (is that a word?), and it is a very simple shot that makes you stop and think, "what does he mean with this picture?"   I think maybe if the hands were falling out of the frame I would like it more.', '2002-06-20 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
