(73684, 2445, 1, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer to have this person bend backwards to alleviate the crease in the stomach.  Still a good shot.</td>', 'I''d prefer to have this person bend backwards to alleviate the crease in the stomach.  Still a good shot.', '2002-06-23 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(73685, 2445, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot, john, but something bothers me about it. i think it''s the cropping, mostly. it''s kind of an awkward section and pose. but everything else is really nice. the focus, lighting, and "shadows" are great. i like the blue tone a lot, and i like that the blacks are very true black. good job.</td>', 'this is a great shot, john, but something bothers me about it. i think it''s the cropping, mostly. it''s kind of an awkward section and pose. but everything else is really nice. the focus, lighting, and "shadows" are great. i like the blue tone a lot, and i like that the blacks are very true black. good job.', '2002-06-24 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
