(73728, 2448, 772, '<td valign="top">I like your idea here!  this is a really neat execution.. very unique!  I''m also glad to see another fan of the microbrews... I haven''t had the Harpoon IPA, but I have enjoyed a few of the Harpoon Lagers... Is this shadow from a stencil held above the image??? great work!  = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like your idea here!  this is a really neat execution.. very unique!  I''m also glad to see another fan of the microbrews... I haven''t had the Harpoon IPA, but I have enjoyed a few of the Harpoon Lagers... Is this shadow from a stencil held above the image??? great work!  = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-19 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
