(73758, 2449, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of the tonal range in this photo.  The complications caused by contrasts, sharpness, and focus issues are not present in this image.  I also really like the way that the pixels are aligned in nice vertical and horizontal rows, creating a nice series of geometries that tease my eyes...  I want a signed print of this one when the challenge is over...</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of the tonal range in this photo.  The complications caused by contrasts, sharpness, and focus issues are not present in this image.  I also really like the way that the pixels are aligned in nice vertical and horizontal rows, creating a nice series of geometries that tease my eyes...  I want a signed print of this one when the challenge is over...', '2002-06-17 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
