(73915, 2453, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the message this picture has, and I like the basic idea behind the set-up.  The biggest problem I see with it is the hands and the shadow are too far apart,  so you loose impact.  also, having the hands at the edge of the planter doesn''t seem to help.</td>', 'I like the message this picture has, and I like the basic idea behind the set-up.  The biggest problem I see with it is the hands and the shadow are too far apart,  so you loose impact.  also, having the hands at the edge of the planter doesn''t seem to help.', '2002-06-23 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
