(73996, 2457, 1175, '<td valign="top">what shadow? down in the lower corner?  I''m seeing double vision.  is that supposed to be your shadow?  Doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'what shadow? down in the lower corner?  I''m seeing double vision.  is that supposed to be your shadow?  Doesn''t work for me.', '2002-06-21 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(73997, 2457, 774, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments. I did expect that a lot of voters would miss the idea. However, I did not expect that many of you. Anyway, I think some dictionary definitions, as posted by (who?) in the forum would help to see "the shadow." Cheers.<br/><br/>An imperfect imitation or copy. <br/><br/>A mirrored image or reflection. <br/><br/>A phantom; a ghost. <br/><br/>One, such as a detective or spy, that follows or trails another. <br/><br/>A constant companion. <br/><br/>A faint indication; a foreshadowing. <br/><br/>To represent vaguely, mysteriously, or prophetically. <br/><br/>To change by gradual degrees. <br/><br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments. I did expect that a lot of voters would miss the idea. However, I did not expect that many of you. Anyway, I think some dictionary definitions, as posted by (who?) in the forum would help to see "the shadow." Cheers.An imperfect imitation or copy. A mirrored image or reflection. A phantom; a ghost. One, such as a detective or spy, that follows or trails another. A constant companion. A faint indication; a foreshadowing. To represent vaguely, mysteriously, or prophetically. To change by gradual degrees. ', '2002-06-24 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(73998, 2458, 2193, '<td valign="top">Took me a second to notice that was a bee caught in mid-flight!</td>', 'Took me a second to notice that was a bee caught in mid-flight!', '2002-06-17 04:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(73999, 2458, 1856, '<td valign="top">Love the vine shadows and the bee (though I didnt'' know what it was initially).  I think there''s too much going on in this picture.  I tried cropping (with some paper on the screen) the yellow thing out but the picture seemed to miss it...may''bee'' it''s perfect afterall.  : P</td>', 'Love the vine shadows and the bee (though I didnt'' know what it was initially).  I think there''s too much going on in this picture.  I tried cropping (with some paper on the screen) the yellow thing out but the picture seemed to miss it...may''bee'' it''s perfect afterall.  : P', '2002-06-17 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74000, 2458, 772, '<td valign="top">This is quite an amazing capture.... I hope the viewers here take the time to discover that is actually in this photo... I didn''t see it from the thumbnail and I didn''t see it immediately when I opened the photo full size... This photo scores very well with me on creativity and meeting the challenge... good job!</td>', 'This is quite an amazing capture.... I hope the viewers here take the time to discover that is actually in this photo... I didn''t see it from the thumbnail and I didn''t see it immediately when I opened the photo full size... This photo scores very well with me on creativity and meeting the challenge... good job!', '2002-06-17 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
