(74190, 2470, 1658, '<td valign="top">i like it.  it sort of reminds me of an old episode of Batman, probably because of the tilted angle.  also brings to mind drunken stumbling to the door out of bar, but that''s a story for another day.</td>', 'i like it.  it sort of reminds me of an old episode of Batman, probably because of the tilted angle.  also brings to mind drunken stumbling to the door out of bar, but that''s a story for another day.', '2002-06-18 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74191, 2470, 1485, '<td valign="top">this is a very very boring image</td>', 'this is a very very boring image', '2002-06-19 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74192, 2470, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wicked angle!  blurry and grainy, sorry, do you have a lower end camera?  Photo 3 Creativity 5 Shadows 4 total 4</td>', 'Wicked angle!  blurry and grainy, sorry, do you have a lower end camera?  Photo 3 Creativity 5 Shadows 4 total 4', '2002-06-19 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74193, 2470, 244, '<td valign="top">Kinda looks like a screen shot from a video game either Silent Hill or Residdent Evil</td>', 'Kinda looks like a screen shot from a video game either Silent Hill or Residdent Evil', '2002-06-19 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74194, 2470, 2284, '<td valign="top">Nice color &amp; Lighting, but capture position not good</td>', 'Nice color & Lighting, but capture position not good', '2002-06-19 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74195, 2470, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, tilt, moody colours. It gives me the feeling I''m in a first person shooter game.</td>', 'Nice composition, tilt, moody colours. It gives me the feeling I''m in a first person shooter game.', '2002-06-20 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74196, 2470, 2243, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the angle</td>', 'I like the use of the angle', '2002-06-21 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74197, 2470, 2346, '<td valign="top">I found that this photo displayed the theme of the over all challenge very well. The shadows are subtle yet noticable. The point of view really makes the whole shot.</td>', 'I found that this photo displayed the theme of the over all challenge very well. The shadows are subtle yet noticable. The point of view really makes the whole shot.', '2002-06-21 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74198, 2470, 1, '<td valign="top">A little blurry and poorly composed.</td>', 'A little blurry and poorly composed.', '2002-06-21 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74199, 2470, 637, '<td valign="top">The angle doesn''t help or harm the image.  Would like to see the EXIT light a little sharper... same for the shadows.</td>', 'The angle doesn''t help or harm the image.  Would like to see the EXIT light a little sharper... same for the shadows.', '2002-06-23 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74200, 2473, 718, '<td valign="top">Would have been a better pic if the stars were a little more in focus.</td>', 'Would have been a better pic if the stars were a little more in focus.', '2002-06-17 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74201, 2473, 92, '<td valign="top">This would be really nice against white paper. The house siding make this more a snapshot:(</td>', 'This would be really nice against white paper. The house siding make this more a snapshot:(', '2002-06-17 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74202, 2473, 2094, '<td valign="top">A little grainy in the shadow areas, but very nice composition and colors!</td>', 'A little grainy in the shadow areas, but very nice composition and colors!', '2002-06-17 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74203, 2473, 436, '<td valign="top">nice try. what if you controlled the light, like a flashlight or something? too thin above, but nice shadow</td>', 'nice try. what if you controlled the light, like a flashlight or something? too thin above, but nice shadow', '2002-06-17 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74204, 2473, 1041, '<td valign="top">This was one of the ideas (kind of) I had, too.  I was thinking of making a trip to my local church and taking shots of the stainglass windows.  Anyway, I think this photo could have done with a flat background, the shadows thrown by the wood distract from the shadow you want the viewer looking at.  I like the composition of where the star and its reflection are positioned in the shot.</td>', 'This was one of the ideas (kind of) I had, too.  I was thinking of making a trip to my local church and taking shots of the stainglass windows.  Anyway, I think this photo could have done with a flat background, the shadows thrown by the wood distract from the shadow you want the viewer looking at.  I like the composition of where the star and its reflection are positioned in the shot.', '2002-06-17 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74205, 2473, 1759, '<td valign="top">Not a bad concept, but that background really doesn''t cut it. You might try either blasting it with light to blow it out and effectively make it dissapear, or put a jumbo piece of paper in front of it.</td>', 'Not a bad concept, but that background really doesn''t cut it. You might try either blasting it with light to blow it out and effectively make it dissapear, or put a jumbo piece of paper in front of it.', '2002-06-18 02:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74206, 2473, 1054, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a tighter crop on this.  With the current crop, the string is a distraction.</td>', 'I would have liked a tighter crop on this.  With the current crop, the string is a distraction.', '2002-06-18 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74207, 2473, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of catching the color of the stained glass in your shadow, plus including both the subject (the shadow) and what created the subject (the stained glass) was a nice touch, esp. for those who like closure (like me).  The upper part of the wall washed out, over exposed.  The right hand side shadow appears grainy and a bit like dotted color lines, probably undesired.  I don''t know exactly what causes this (you might want to ask in the forums next week), but it''s very distracting and reduces the overall effectiveness of this picture.  I hope this helps.  Photo 7 Creativity 7 Shadows 7 total 7</td>', 'I like the idea of catching the color of the stained glass in your shadow, plus including both the subject (the shadow) and what created the subject (the stained glass) was a nice touch, esp. for those who like closure (like me).  The upper part of the wall washed out, over exposed.  The right hand side shadow appears grainy and a bit like dotted color lines, probably undesired.  I don''t know exactly what causes this (you might want to ask in the forums next week), but it''s very distracting and reduces the overall effectiveness of this picture.  I hope this helps.  Photo 7 Creativity 7 Shadows 7 total 7', '2002-06-19 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74208, 2473, 772, '<td valign="top">The colorful shadows here are very interesting but the overexposed portion of this photo is fairly annoying in this shot... Photographing subjects where a portion of the area is extremely lighter or darker than another area can fool your camera into ''metering'' in the wrong direction.  Shots like this aren''t as easy as they may seem... - jmsetzler</td>', 'The colorful shadows here are very interesting but the overexposed portion of this photo is fairly annoying in this shot... Photographing subjects where a portion of the area is extremely lighter or darker than another area can fool your camera into ''metering'' in the wrong direction.  Shots like this aren''t as easy as they may seem... - jmsetzler', '2002-06-20 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74209, 2473, 1, '<td valign="top">The background is distracting... the shadow on the right distracts from the star shadows... as does the slab of wood down the left side.</td>', 'The background is distracting... the shadow on the right distracts from the star shadows... as does the slab of wood down the left side.', '2002-06-21 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(74210, 2477, 2193, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast...</td>', 'Nice contrast...', '2002-06-17 03:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74211, 2477, 92, '<td valign="top">I love this ! Such fun action ! <br/><br/>My only critique would be the white is just a bit light.</td>', 'I love this ! Such fun action ! My only critique would be the white is just a bit light.', '2002-06-17 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74212, 2477, 2023, '<td valign="top">Awesome, really captured the theme!!</td>', 'Awesome, really captured the theme!!', '2002-06-17 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74213, 2477, 741, '<td valign="top">Great idea - might have looked better if the camera had been stright on to the wall.  As it is, it looks like the left hand side is falling away.</td>', 'Great idea - might have looked better if the camera had been stright on to the wall.  As it is, it looks like the left hand side is falling away.', '2002-06-17 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74214, 2477, 1944, '<td valign="top">I thought there''d be a lot of pictures like this, and there are, but yours is one of the best.</td>', 'I thought there''d be a lot of pictures like this, and there are, but yours is one of the best.', '2002-06-17 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74215, 2477, 1759, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. It reminds me of something I once saw in a magazine.  The texture of the surface that the shadow is projected on works very well. The shadow is very dark and well defined. I think I would like it better with a slight cropping from the left and the top, but that''s just my personal taste. Very good job on this one.</td>', 'I really like this one. It reminds me of something I once saw in a magazine.  The texture of the surface that the shadow is projected on works very well. The shadow is very dark and well defined. I think I would like it better with a slight cropping from the left and the top, but that''s just my personal taste. Very good job on this one.', '2002-06-17 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74216, 2477, 441, '<td valign="top">great total shadow 9</td>', 'great total shadow 9', '2002-06-17 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74217, 2477, 1313, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shadow</td>', 'Nice crisp shadow', '2002-06-17 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74218, 2477, 2199, '<td valign="top">Very nice.....I love the shadow, the angle, and the texture of the cement.</td>', 'Very nice.....I love the shadow, the angle, and the texture of the cement.', '2002-06-17 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74219, 2477, 1666, '<td valign="top">This is sensational. Congratulations! It captures  the challenge perfectly and is well shot. Its a 10 for me.</td>', 'This is sensational. Congratulations! It captures  the challenge perfectly and is well shot. Its a 10 for me.', '2002-06-17 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74220, 2477, 1856, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Matisse.  Love the sharpness/contrast of the shadow.</td>', 'Reminds me of Matisse.  Love the sharpness/contrast of the shadow.', '2002-06-17 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74221, 2477, 671, '<td valign="top">To me, this entry best personifies the challenge.  Well done!</td>', 'To me, this entry best personifies the challenge.  Well done!', '2002-06-18 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74222, 2477, 1599, '<td valign="top">Seen it</td>', 'Seen it', '2002-06-18 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74223, 2477, 1882, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe you were the only one to shoot a shadow like this, so you get high scores from me for creativity!  Very cool shot!</td>', 'I can''t believe you were the only one to shoot a shadow like this, so you get high scores from me for creativity!  Very cool shot!', '2002-06-18 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74224, 2477, 573, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast and texture.  Would this high contrast have worked in color also?</td>', 'I like the contrast and texture.  Would this high contrast have worked in color also?', '2002-06-18 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74225, 2477, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution.  I would have loved to see the "dancer" at the top of the frame rather than the bottom.</td>', 'Great idea and execution.  I would have loved to see the "dancer" at the top of the frame rather than the bottom.', '2002-06-18 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74226, 2477, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.  I like the arm positioning, wicked!  Photo 8 Creativity 10 Shadows 9 total 9</td>', 'Great action shot.  I like the arm positioning, wicked!  Photo 8 Creativity 10 Shadows 9 total 9', '2002-06-18 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74227, 2477, 554, '<td valign="top">perfect----good sharp shadow----10</td>', 'perfect----good sharp shadow----10', '2002-06-18 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74228, 2477, 875, '<td valign="top">I love the splayed fingers and the feeling of flying or floating.  The contrast is wonderful.</td>', 'I love the splayed fingers and the feeling of flying or floating.  The contrast is wonderful.', '2002-06-19 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74229, 2477, 527, '<td valign="top">It just needs something more, but I still like it overall. I think it''s the wall that I don''t like.</td>', 'It just needs something more, but I still like it overall. I think it''s the wall that I don''t like.', '2002-06-19 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74230, 2477, 1793, '<td valign="top">wow! super take on the person-shadow photograph!</td>', 'wow! super take on the person-shadow photograph!', '2002-06-19 03:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74231, 2477, 2110, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed. I guess you would have taken a lot of eperimental shots before you finally entered this one!Texture int he front is I guess a little disturbing so may be a leseer DOF would have helped.</td>', 'Very nicely composed. I guess you would have taken a lot of eperimental shots before you finally entered this one!Texture int he front is I guess a little disturbing so may be a leseer DOF would have helped.', '2002-06-19 06:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74232, 2477, 2221, '<td valign="top">one of my favourites. the very sharp contrast fits good.</td>', 'one of my favourites. the very sharp contrast fits good.', '2002-06-19 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74233, 2477, 1585, '<td valign="top">I would love to know how this was done. Nice.</td>', 'I would love to know how this was done. Nice.', '2002-06-19 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74234, 2477, 737, '<td valign="top">After a couple of looks, all I can say is - great shot. Clean and artistic. Among the top for me.</td>', 'After a couple of looks, all I can say is - great shot. Clean and artistic. Among the top for me.', '2002-06-20 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74235, 2477, 1041, '<td valign="top">That''s kinda cool.  I like it!</td>', 'That''s kinda cool.  I like it!', '2002-06-20 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74236, 2477, 772, '<td valign="top">GREAT shadow!  Excellent contrast against the background as well... Only improvement that I could offer would be to possibly crop a little tighter maybe?  Good work! - jmsetzler<br/></td>', 'GREAT shadow!  Excellent contrast against the background as well... Only improvement that I could offer would be to possibly crop a little tighter maybe?  Good work! - jmsetzler', '2002-06-20 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74237, 2477, 244, '<td valign="top">This is in my top 5, I like the idea behind this shot, kinda reminds me of Peter Pan trying to catch his shadow.  It portrays a picture of someone leaping into the great unknown.  Wonderful fulfillment of hte challenge.  Score 8 --------- Corey</td>', 'This is in my top 5, I like the idea behind this shot, kinda reminds me of Peter Pan trying to catch his shadow.  It portrays a picture of someone leaping into the great unknown.  Wonderful fulfillment of hte challenge.  Score 8 --------- Corey', '2002-06-22 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74238, 2477, 1, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the frozen action is superb.  I''d love to see a howto for this one.</td>', 'Great shot, the frozen action is superb.  I''d love to see a howto for this one.', '2002-06-23 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74239, 2477, 661, '<td valign="top">I really like this submission.  Nice Clarity.  Good action.</td>', 'I really like this submission.  Nice Clarity.  Good action.', '2002-06-24 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74240, 2477, 312, '<td valign="top">very nice shadow, but something bothers me about this shot. i think it''s the texture of the background, mostly, which kind of cuts into the shadow and makes it look too sharp. i think the out of focus left side also bothers me a bit. a different crop might be nice, too, maybe moving the figure over to the left side to get rid of that soft focus and creating more negative space. overall, though, a nice shot.</td>', 'very nice shadow, but something bothers me about this shot. i think it''s the texture of the background, mostly, which kind of cuts into the shadow and makes it look too sharp. i think the out of focus left side also bothers me a bit. a different crop might be nice, too, maybe moving the figure over to the left side to get rid of that soft focus and creating more negative space. overall, though, a nice shot.', '2002-06-24 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74241, 2478, 1054, '<td valign="top">I like the shot through the tent... the use of blus is effective here, hope you don''t get hammered for it.</td>', 'I like the shot through the tent... the use of blus is effective here, hope you don''t get hammered for it.', '2002-06-17 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74242, 2478, 387, '<td valign="top">Focus, focus, FOCUS!</td>', 'Focus, focus, FOCUS!', '2002-06-17 07:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74243, 2478, 772, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... something is aloof here.. if the lack of focus on this shot is intentional under the guise of ''artistic'', I''m not sure it''s the kind of art that appeals to me :)</td>', 'Hmmm... something is aloof here.. if the lack of focus on this shot is intentional under the guise of ''artistic'', I''m not sure it''s the kind of art that appeals to me :)', '2002-06-17 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74244, 2478, 1005, '<td valign="top">Soft focus?   (auto focus problem?)  Sorry, don''t work for me.   Going for some sort of Blare Witch thing?  (reminds me of that)<br/>Photo 3 Creativity 5 Shadows 6 total 4  (if you were going for soft focus, give yourself a couple more points, but really)</td>', 'Soft focus?   (auto focus problem?)  Sorry, don''t work for me.   Going for some sort of Blare Witch thing?  (reminds me of that)Photo 3 Creativity 5 Shadows 6 total 4  (if you were going for soft focus, give yourself a couple more points, but really)', '2002-06-17 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74245, 2478, 1897, '<td valign="top">I am not sure this captured the affect you wanted.  is the person inside a tent? it is hard to tell</td>', 'I am not sure this captured the affect you wanted.  is the person inside a tent? it is hard to tell', '2002-06-17 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74246, 2478, 1041, '<td valign="top">Too unfocus for my liking.  But it definitely meets the challenge.</td>', 'Too unfocus for my liking.  But it definitely meets the challenge.', '2002-06-17 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74247, 2478, 2225, '<td valign="top">it looks like yoda.</td>', 'it looks like yoda.', '2002-06-17 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74248, 2478, 1759, '<td valign="top">Pretty blurry, to the point that I can''t decide what I''m looking at.</td>', 'Pretty blurry, to the point that I can''t decide what I''m looking at.', '2002-06-17 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74249, 2478, 1856, '<td valign="top">too blurry...not sure what else might improve this photo.</td>', 'too blurry...not sure what else might improve this photo.', '2002-06-18 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74250, 2478, 1599, '<td valign="top">I love camping, nice shot.  I like your style</td>', 'I love camping, nice shot.  I like your style', '2002-06-18 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74251, 2478, 2235, '<td valign="top">A bit too out of focus for me. Detracts from the idea you have in place. Good idea and placement. Exposure also showing contrast.</td>', 'A bit too out of focus for me. Detracts from the idea you have in place. Good idea and placement. Exposure also showing contrast.', '2002-06-18 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74252, 2478, 2110, '<td valign="top">The top black patch is overpowering. tighter corpping would have helped!</td>', 'The top black patch is overpowering. tighter corpping would have helped!', '2002-06-19 06:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74253, 2478, 1, '<td valign="top">Way outta focus it seems.</td>', 'Way outta focus it seems.', '2002-06-23 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74254, 2481, 593, '<td valign="top">Very good!</td>', 'Very good!', '2002-06-17 02:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74255, 2481, 1856, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Great lighting, colors, texture...</td>', 'I love this.  Great lighting, colors, texture...', '2002-06-17 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74256, 2481, 1897, '<td valign="top">the color combinations are not pleasing.</td>', 'the color combinations are not pleasing.', '2002-06-17 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74257, 2481, 1175, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  very creative to use a different color to display the shadows rather than white as many other posts.</td>', 'Very nice.  very creative to use a different color to display the shadows rather than white as many other posts.', '2002-06-17 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74258, 2481, 2172, '<td valign="top">Interesting Creative- Just curious - would that be a blue rug? -</td>', 'Interesting Creative- Just curious - would that be a blue rug? -', '2002-06-17 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74259, 2481, 2109, '<td valign="top">nice lighting effect</td>', 'nice lighting effect', '2002-06-17 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74260, 2481, 1944, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I know it''s difficult, but some of the branches are burned out a bit. I''ve been having trouble also getting acceptable sharpness with highly detailed subjects like yours after I''ve compressed them for the competition. Finall I had to use my back-up photo.</td>', 'Very pretty. I know it''s difficult, but some of the branches are burned out a bit. I''ve been having trouble also getting acceptable sharpness with highly detailed subjects like yours after I''ve compressed them for the competition. Finall I had to use my back-up photo.', '2002-06-17 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74261, 2481, 2094, '<td valign="top">Awseome lighting and shadows... The way the plant stands out so brightly from the darkness is just great. Really great setup and photo!</td>', 'Awseome lighting and shadows... The way the plant stands out so brightly from the darkness is just great. Really great setup and photo!', '2002-06-18 07:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74262, 2481, 1908, '<td valign="top">simply stunning, well done</td>', 'simply stunning, well done', '2002-06-18 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74263, 2481, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good exposure, and nice night shadow shot.</td>', 'Good exposure, and nice night shadow shot.', '2002-06-18 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74264, 2481, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nicely subtle  -  are you using a pro studio?  (intended as a compliment)  The flowers might be a little overly busy, but wow, otherwise great job!<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 8 Shadows 9 total 9</td>', 'Nicely subtle  -  are you using a pro studio?  (intended as a compliment)  The flowers might be a little overly busy, but wow, otherwise great job!Photo 9 Creativity 8 Shadows 9 total 9', '2002-06-18 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74265, 2481, 1831, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between light and shade :-)</td>', 'Nice contrast between light and shade :-)', '2002-06-18 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74266, 2481, 1569, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors--it looks like it is over sharpened though.A little softer and it would rank higher.</td>', 'I really like the colors--it looks like it is over sharpened though.A little softer and it would rank higher.', '2002-06-18 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74267, 2481, 772, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a nice effect... I like the shadow shots this week that incorporated color into the shadows in some way... very nice!</td>', 'This is definitely a nice effect... I like the shadow shots this week that incorporated color into the shadows in some way... very nice!', '2002-06-18 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74268, 2481, 2247, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of light and dark.</td>', 'Nice contrast of light and dark.', '2002-06-18 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74269, 2481, 875, '<td valign="top">I love the white/blue/black color scheme and the funky shadows.  The bit of light flare(?) at the top is the only thing I''d change.</td>', 'I love the white/blue/black color scheme and the funky shadows.  The bit of light flare(?) at the top is the only thing I''d change.', '2002-06-19 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74270, 2481, 2199, '<td valign="top">very nice!</td>', 'very nice!', '2002-06-19 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
