(74403, 2496, 1856, '<td valign="top">Wow...striking image.  I love the clean, crisp lines/shadows.  Great contrast.</td>', 'Wow...striking image.  I love the clean, crisp lines/shadows.  Great contrast.', '2002-06-17 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
