(74485, 2502, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great, another photo that makes the shadow its main focus - surprisingly, there are not many of them.  I like the pose. Also just played around with your photo in some editing software, I think it would''ve been much more striking if you had played with the contrast and gamma a bit to create more of a black &amp; white, rather than gray &amp; gray image.</td>', 'Great, another photo that makes the shadow its main focus - surprisingly, there are not many of them.  I like the pose. Also just played around with your photo in some editing software, I think it would''ve been much more striking if you had played with the contrast and gamma a bit to create more of a black & white, rather than gray & gray image.', '2002-06-18 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
