(74498, 2503, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot... I love the tone and mood as well as the shadows cast by the windows in this view... the only thing I can see that could have possibly made this shot a bit better would have been to lift the camera up off the wooden surface just enought to allow the depth of field to focus the wood survace just a lilttle more.. .good shot!</td>', 'This is a very nice shot... I love the tone and mood as well as the shadows cast by the windows in this view... the only thing I can see that could have possibly made this shot a bit better would have been to lift the camera up off the wooden surface just enought to allow the depth of field to focus the wood survace just a lilttle more.. .good shot!', '2002-06-17 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
