(74543, 2506, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice color/focus, a bit strong light reflection off the main leaf.  What created the shadows?  (I know another plant, but I was hinting that it might be nice to include a bit of them, too, in order to complete the story.  Photo 8 Creativity 5 Shadows 7 total 7</td>', 'Nice color/focus, a bit strong light reflection off the main leaf.  What created the shadows?  (I know another plant, but I was hinting that it might be nice to include a bit of them, too, in order to complete the story.  Photo 8 Creativity 5 Shadows 7 total 7', '2002-06-19 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
