(74548, 2506, 312, '<td valign="top">i like the shadows here a lot. i can''t really say a lot about this picture. it''s well focused and composed, and it''s got a pretty interesting subject. it doesn''t really "pop" at me, though, which is why i can''t score it really high. but it''s definitely well done.</td>', 'i like the shadows here a lot. i can''t really say a lot about this picture. it''s well focused and composed, and it''s got a pretty interesting subject. it doesn''t really "pop" at me, though, which is why i can''t score it really high. but it''s definitely well done.', '2002-06-24 00:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74549, 2508, 1856, '<td valign="top">I like the subject of the picture.  I wish I could see it in color.  This would have gotten a higher score from me if you had been able to photo at a time of day when the shadows were more striking.</td>', 'I like the subject of the picture.  I wish I could see it in color.  This would have gotten a higher score from me if you had been able to photo at a time of day when the shadows were more striking.', '2002-06-17 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74550, 2508, 1944, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed photo. I think it''s a little over sharpened, as I can see some unsharp mask effects on high contrast boundries. I don''t know what ISO you used, but there''s some noise in the flat color areas. Actually though, I think it gives an interesting texture to the sky and the shadow in the belfry.</td>', 'Nicely composed photo. I think it''s a little over sharpened, as I can see some unsharp mask effects on high contrast boundries. I don''t know what ISO you used, but there''s some noise in the flat color areas. Actually though, I think it gives an interesting texture to the sky and the shadow in the belfry.', '2002-06-17 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
