(74573, 2511, 2221, '<td valign="top">nice lighting! the yellow spot in the upper right is a little distracting but nevertheless i like the picture. maybe a bit more focus.</td>', 'nice lighting! the yellow spot in the upper right is a little distracting but nevertheless i like the picture. maybe a bit more focus.', '2002-06-19 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74574, 2511, 1856, '<td valign="top">This just missed the mark for me.  Too blurry and though there is a shadow there...it''s not very interesting.  I think I would have liked this more without the shadow.  I like the edge of the leaf, light spot, and blurred background.</td>', 'This just missed the mark for me.  Too blurry and though there is a shadow there...it''s not very interesting.  I think I would have liked this more without the shadow.  I like the edge of the leaf, light spot, and blurred background.', '2002-06-19 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74575, 2511, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice composition.  I really like the highlight along the right edge of this leaf.  The hidden shadow is very nice as well...  The detail in the leaf is excellent and would be even more so if the focus was a little sharper on this particular image :) good work! - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a very nice composition.  I really like the highlight along the right edge of this leaf.  The hidden shadow is very nice as well...  The detail in the leaf is excellent and would be even more so if the focus was a little sharper on this particular image :) good work! - jmsetzler', '2002-06-19 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74576, 2511, 1, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really look like it''s in focus, if it was it''d probably have more detail.</td>', 'Doesn''t really look like it''s in focus, if it was it''d probably have more detail.', '2002-06-23 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74577, 2512, 1005, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing this, but not co-ordinated enough.  Technically good as far as it goes, but a bit empty.   Nit:  left edge could have been cropped more, look at the corners.  Photo 6 Creativity 6 Shadow 7 total 6</td>', 'I thought about doing this, but not co-ordinated enough.  Technically good as far as it goes, but a bit empty.   Nit:  left edge could have been cropped more, look at the corners.  Photo 6 Creativity 6 Shadow 7 total 6', '2002-06-17 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74578, 2512, 327, '<td valign="top">lol cute idea.</td>', 'lol cute idea.', '2002-06-17 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74579, 2512, 441, '<td valign="top">25Kb only used! - get in closer</td>', '25Kb only used! - get in closer', '2002-06-17 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74580, 2512, 1054, '<td valign="top">The dark corners are a distraction.</td>', 'The dark corners are a distraction.', '2002-06-17 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74581, 2512, 1856, '<td valign="top">Is that a bald eagle barking at Al Queda?  I like the political statement made by the raised middle finger on the hand.  Very subtle.</td>', 'Is that a bald eagle barking at Al Queda?  I like the political statement made by the raised middle finger on the hand.  Very subtle.', '2002-06-17 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74582, 2512, 1599, '<td valign="top">everyone did the hand puppets</td>', 'everyone did the hand puppets', '2002-06-18 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74583, 2512, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shadow.. i would like this shot better if the dark corners on the left of the frame were not there... - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a neat shadow.. i would like this shot better if the dark corners on the left of the frame were not there... - jmsetzler', '2002-06-19 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74584, 2512, 570, '<td valign="top">squash your head</td>', 'squash your head', '2002-06-20 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74585, 2512, 1031, '<td valign="top">"Grrr..WHAT did you say you were gonna vote on his pic?" Nice job.</td>', '"Grrr..WHAT did you say you were gonna vote on his pic?" Nice job.', '2002-06-21 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74586, 2512, 1, '<td valign="top">Too much blank space, too little composure.</td>', 'Too much blank space, too little composure.', '2002-06-21 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74587, 2512, 2140, '<td valign="top">how old are you?</td>', 'how old are you?', '2002-06-22 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74588, 2512, 637, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer to only see the shadow.</td>', 'I''d prefer to only see the shadow.', '2002-06-23 02:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74589, 2512, 661, '<td valign="top">Junior Bird Man.... Angry junior bird man?</td>', 'Junior Bird Man.... Angry junior bird man?', '2002-06-23 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74590, 2512, 2221, '<td valign="top">Many thanks to all for your comments. That was my first challenge and I was really excited what would come out of it. When I saw the other entries my excitement dropped heavily ;-) Anyway it helped me a lot learning some things.<br/><br/>iban: I tried your suggestion but it didn''t make my photo any better...<br/><br/>willsy66: I''m 25 but I don''t know what that has to do with the photo. Want to make new friends in your age? ;-)<br/><br/>Lisa: I laughed out loud about your view on my photo :-) But I never intended any political statement with that (not yet). The raised middle finger is the "eye" of the shadow.<br/><br/>As for the shape of the shadow. Any similarities to real world characters are purely coincidental ;-) It was the best figure I could do and somehow I found it looked a bit funny.<br/><br/>The dark corners... I knew it was not good, but I did a big mistake. I took the photo in 640x480 so I couldn''t crop it. Also the whole shot would have been even more uncentered and it was already a lot (strange that nobody noticed that).<br/></td>', 'Many thanks to all for your comments. That was my first challenge and I was really excited what would come out of it. When I saw the other entries my excitement dropped heavily ;-) Anyway it helped me a lot learning some things.iban: I tried your suggestion but it didn''t make my photo any better...willsy66: I''m 25 but I don''t know what that has to do with the photo. Want to make new friends in your age? ;-)Lisa: I laughed out loud about your view on my photo :-) But I never intended any political statement with that (not yet). The raised middle finger is the "eye" of the shadow.As for the shape of the shadow. Any similarities to real world characters are purely coincidental ;-) It was the best figure I could do and somehow I found it looked a bit funny.The dark corners... I knew it was not good, but I did a big mistake. I took the photo in 640x480 so I couldn''t crop it. Also the whole shot would have been even more uncentered and it was already a lot (strange that nobody noticed that).', '2002-06-25 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(74591, 2513, 1856, '<td valign="top">I''d crop the highlighted part of the hook out.  It''s distracting.  Also, the light is a little harsh in contrast to the rest of the image...maybe a smaller candle or a darker shade of wax would be better??  I reallly like the warm/coppery tones.</td>', 'I''d crop the highlighted part of the hook out.  It''s distracting.  Also, the light is a little harsh in contrast to the rest of the image...maybe a smaller candle or a darker shade of wax would be better??  I reallly like the warm/coppery tones.', '2002-06-17 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74592, 2513, 570, '<td valign="top">not good</td>', 'not good', '2002-06-17 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74593, 2513, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice plant shadow here. Like that red.</td>', 'Nice plant shadow here. Like that red.', '2002-06-17 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74594, 2513, 2109, '<td valign="top">good photo... a bit grainy, but that could be attributed to jpeg compression</td>', 'good photo... a bit grainy, but that could be attributed to jpeg compression', '2002-06-17 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74595, 2513, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice.   It''s a bit dark/confusing, but I like the red cast.  Low light digital photography is HARD.  <br/>Photo 7 Creativity 7 Shadows 7 total 7</td>', 'Pretty nice.   It''s a bit dark/confusing, but I like the red cast.  Low light digital photography is HARD.  Photo 7 Creativity 7 Shadows 7 total 7', '2002-06-17 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74596, 2513, 573, '<td valign="top">I opened this photograph to make a comment and just sat here enjoying it.  I immagins some comments are giong to say ''too dark'' or ''too grainy'' but I like i9t just the way it is, one of my top ten picks.</td>', 'I opened this photograph to make a comment and just sat here enjoying it.  I immagins some comments are giong to say ''too dark'' or ''too grainy'' but I like i9t just the way it is, one of my top ten picks.', '2002-06-18 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74597, 2513, 1175, '<td valign="top">Its a little difficult to tell what''s going on here.  But I love the shapes and the color, great abstract photo.  Picture is also grainy.  Not sure if you added this on purpose or not but I like it.</td>', 'Its a little difficult to tell what''s going on here.  But I love the shapes and the color, great abstract photo.  Picture is also grainy.  Not sure if you added this on purpose or not but I like it.', '2002-06-18 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74598, 2513, 554, '<td valign="top">pretty</td>', 'pretty', '2002-06-19 00:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74599, 2513, 527, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. I think it could use even more contrast.</td>', 'Nice colors. I think it could use even more contrast.', '2002-06-19 00:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74600, 2513, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color, and the graininess adds something to this.</td>', 'Nice use of color, and the graininess adds something to this.', '2002-06-19 06:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74601, 2513, 2173, '<td valign="top">i like it a lot</td>', 'i like it a lot', '2002-06-19 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74602, 2513, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I love the rich red colouring.</td>', 'Gorgeous! I love the rich red colouring.', '2002-06-19 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74603, 2513, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the red glow in this photo but the overall image just doesn''t appeal to me.  I can''t really say why... :( - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like the red glow in this photo but the overall image just doesn''t appeal to me.  I can''t really say why... :( - jmsetzler', '2002-06-20 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74604, 2513, 1, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer a tighter crop on the vivid shadows.</td>', 'I''d prefer a tighter crop on the vivid shadows.', '2002-06-23 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74605, 2514, 92, '<td valign="top">VERY nice !</td>', 'VERY nice !', '2002-06-17 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74606, 2514, 441, '<td valign="top">good composition</td>', 'good composition', '2002-06-17 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74607, 2514, 737, '<td valign="top">Well executed. Good choice for subject. Top 10.</td>', 'Well executed. Good choice for subject. Top 10.', '2002-06-17 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74608, 2514, 2199, '<td valign="top">I love the background color and how it works with the color of the glasses. Very nice composition.</td>', 'I love the background color and how it works with the color of the glasses. Very nice composition.', '2002-06-17 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74609, 2514, 1759, '<td valign="top">In focus, good color combination, simple, decent composition though somewhat static, the geometry is pleasant, It fits the challenge topic well, and is well titled.  Kind of makes me want to see a glass of iced tea with condensation rolling down the sides. Very good.</td>', 'In focus, good color combination, simple, decent composition though somewhat static, the geometry is pleasant, It fits the challenge topic well, and is well titled.  Kind of makes me want to see a glass of iced tea with condensation rolling down the sides. Very good.', '2002-06-18 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(74610, 2514, 1882, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Not only is there a shadow of the lenses in a different color, but the shadow of the plant leaf is a real nice touch.  fantastic color scheme.</td>', 'Very cool.  Not only is there a shadow of the lenses in a different color, but the shadow of the plant leaf is a real nice touch.  fantastic color scheme.', '2002-06-18 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74611, 2514, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation, good use of lines and symmetry as well.</td>', 'Great interpretation, good use of lines and symmetry as well.', '2002-06-18 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74612, 2514, 1005, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective.  No qualms here.  Photo 9 Creativity 8 Shadows 8 total 8</td>', 'Simple and effective.  No qualms here.  Photo 9 Creativity 8 Shadows 8 total 8', '2002-06-18 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74613, 2514, 875, '<td valign="top">I love those orange shadows.  It looks almost like a reflection - very cool!  The branching background is a nice touch.</td>', 'I love those orange shadows.  It looks almost like a reflection - very cool!  The branching background is a nice touch.', '2002-06-19 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74614, 2514, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I love the colours, and the shadow of the plant adds a very dynamic element to the composition.</td>', 'Very cool. I love the colours, and the shadow of the plant adds a very dynamic element to the composition.', '2002-06-19 05:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74615, 2514, 2110, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I would have loved this shot if the center line of the shadow of the leaves and the glasses were perfectly aligned and the image was taken with a more dynamic angle, and a slightly lower point of view. Great job!</td>', 'Great idea! I would have loved this shot if the center line of the shadow of the leaves and the glasses were perfectly aligned and the image was taken with a more dynamic angle, and a slightly lower point of view. Great job!', '2002-06-19 06:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74616, 2514, 2221, '<td valign="top">very nice! i especially like the shadow o fthe palm (?) which makes the background and thus the whole picture more interesting without distracting from the main object.</td>', 'very nice! i especially like the shadow o fthe palm (?) which makes the background and thus the whole picture more interesting without distracting from the main object.', '2002-06-19 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74617, 2514, 142, '<td valign="top">I can just imagine the palm trees swaying outside the window in this photo.  Great job.</td>', 'I can just imagine the palm trees swaying outside the window in this photo.  Great job.', '2002-06-19 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74618, 2514, 2328, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective, a nice shot.</td>', 'Simple and effective, a nice shot.', '2002-06-20 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74619, 2514, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very neat shot... I love the angle and the color...  I''m trying to decide if l like the leaf shadow.  I think it may be a little too much, but maybe not... I would love to see this same shot without that though... good work! - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a very neat shot... I love the angle and the color...  I''m trying to decide if l like the leaf shadow.  I think it may be a little too much, but maybe not... I would love to see this same shot without that though... good work! - jmsetzler', '2002-06-20 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74620, 2514, 1599, '<td valign="top">Different, but Cool</td>', 'Different, but Cool', '2002-06-21 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74621, 2514, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like the combination of the shadow on the table as well as the bright red reflection of the glasses.  Did you paly around at all with different (off center) placement of the glasses?  Not sure I can say ''you should''ve done this IMO'' though, just a thought.  Good photo.</td>', 'I like the combination of the shadow on the table as well as the bright red reflection of the glasses.  Did you paly around at all with different (off center) placement of the glasses?  Not sure I can say ''you should''ve done this IMO'' though, just a thought.  Good photo.', '2002-06-22 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74622, 2514, 2140, '<td valign="top">different</td>', 'different', '2002-06-22 23:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74623, 2514, 637, '<td valign="top">Don''t really like the surface theglasses are resting on, and the incidental shadows cast upon it.  Love the idea and love the execution otherwise.</td>', 'Don''t really like the surface theglasses are resting on, and the incidental shadows cast upon it.  Love the idea and love the execution otherwise.', '2002-06-23 02:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74624, 2514, 1061, '<td valign="top">Amazing color, how was it done?</td>', 'Amazing color, how was it done?', '2002-06-23 04:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74625, 2514, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot, the glasses make for a great shadow... the `spine` is a nice addition too.</td>', 'Nicely shot, the glasses make for a great shadow... the `spine` is a nice addition too.', '2002-06-23 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74626, 2514, 661, '<td valign="top">Reflection and shadows!</td>', 'Reflection and shadows!', '2002-06-24 00:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74627, 2514, 1859, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the nice comments, everybody!</td>', 'Thanks for all the nice comments, everybody!', '2002-06-24 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(74628, 2515, 1054, '<td valign="top">Did the beer make you spell "Scrabble" wrong? ;-)  Seriously, unique idea dn nice framing.  I would have liked to see more DOF but I know that''s difficult in a macro shot.</td>', 'Did the beer make you spell "Scrabble" wrong? ;-)  Seriously, unique idea dn nice framing.  I would have liked to see more DOF but I know that''s difficult in a macro shot.', '2002-06-17 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74629, 2515, 2109, '<td valign="top">good FOV</td>', 'good FOV', '2002-06-17 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74630, 2515, 1755, '<td valign="top">Scrabble</td>', 'Scrabble', '2002-06-17 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74631, 2515, 772, '<td valign="top">Looks like a good combination to me :)</td>', 'Looks like a good combination to me :)', '2002-06-17 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74632, 2515, 1005, '<td valign="top">Better than I first gave you credit.  I like the brown "see through" shadow.  It works.  (waver?  is that a word? use it in a sentence. smile)<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 7 Shadow 8 total 8</td>', 'Better than I first gave you credit.  I like the brown "see through" shadow.  It works.  (waver?  is that a word? use it in a sentence. smile)Photo 9 Creativity 7 Shadow 8 total 8', '2002-06-17 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74633, 2515, 1759, '<td valign="top">Come on over and we can drink some beer and play scrabble. I guess after enough beer it becomes scabble. Did you intend the foreground blurred and the background in focus?</td>', 'Come on over and we can drink some beer and play scrabble. I guess after enough beer it becomes scabble. Did you intend the foreground blurred and the background in focus?', '2002-06-17 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74634, 2515, 1599, '<td valign="top">Should have put a hidden message in the scrabble, then the shadow would have pointed to it, then it would have been even a cooler picture, and you would have had more points in my book</td>', 'Should have put a hidden message in the scrabble, then the shadow would have pointed to it, then it would have been even a cooler picture, and you would have had more points in my book', '2002-06-18 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74635, 2515, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like that you haven''t obviously faked a DPC related game (of course, this could still be faked ...).  I wonder why you chose to put the scrabble upside down.  Interesting angle for the shadow.</td>', 'I like that you haven''t obviously faked a DPC related game (of course, this could still be faked ...).  I wonder why you chose to put the scrabble upside down.  Interesting angle for the shadow.', '2002-06-18 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74636, 2515, 1569, '<td valign="top">Turn the board 180 degrees and add an "r" to the title.Otherwise nice shot. Oh ya---clean up the "E".</td>', 'Turn the board 180 degrees and add an "r" to the title.Otherwise nice shot. Oh ya---clean up the "E".', '2002-06-18 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74637, 2515, 2125, '<td valign="top">I loved how you misspelled scrabble.... too many brews I am taking it  nice picture</td>', 'I loved how you misspelled scrabble.... too many brews I am taking it  nice picture', '2002-06-20 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74639, 2515, 1175, '<td valign="top">Mmm.... Beer.  Uninteresting shadow overall picture.</td>', 'Mmm.... Beer.  Uninteresting shadow overall picture.', '2002-06-21 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
