(74658, 2516, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Centering on the woman is an interesting choice... I feel like it would have worked better if she ws further to the left, but perhaps not. The darkness of the landscape and surroundings needs to be there for the mood. It''s nice the way the left side is all dark and the right side is dominated by the fire, with her dividing the space that way.<br/><br/>I guess my overall feeling is that this photo could be better, but I still really like it.</td>', 'Beautiful! Centering on the woman is an interesting choice... I feel like it would have worked better if she ws further to the left, but perhaps not. The darkness of the landscape and surroundings needs to be there for the mood. It''s nice the way the left side is all dark and the right side is dominated by the fire, with her dividing the space that way.I guess my overall feeling is that this photo could be better, but I still really like it.', '2002-06-19 04:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
