(74661, 2516, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice shot here... I think that your model should possibly be positioned away from the center of the frame... In this case, maybe to the left a little bit :)  good work! - jmsetzler</td>', 'Nice shot here... I think that your model should possibly be positioned away from the center of the frame... In this case, maybe to the left a little bit :)  good work! - jmsetzler', '2002-06-19 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74662, 2516, 1005, '<td valign="top">Going for a soft focus?  Night shots are hard for digi-cams.  Most use IR auto-focus routines that need a certain level of light, just to work.  The flames are a great effect and make wonderful, soft, redish shadows, this is a great concept.  Photo 4 Creativity 8 Shadows 7 total 6</td>', 'Going for a soft focus?  Night shots are hard for digi-cams.  Most use IR auto-focus routines that need a certain level of light, just to work.  The flames are a great effect and make wonderful, soft, redish shadows, this is a great concept.  Photo 4 Creativity 8 Shadows 7 total 6', '2002-06-19 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
