(74735, 2526, 1041, '<td valign="top">Yes, there''s a shadow here (two actually, you are overachieving).  I like the idea of the symmetry, but the pen needs to be placed exactly in the middle (more symmetry) or further to the left (rule of thirds).  You are also not using the whole file size that you could''ve, I''m wondering whether that could''ve gotten rid of some of the compression artifacts, or whether it was just the light conditions and the camera...</td>', 'Yes, there''s a shadow here (two actually, you are overachieving).  I like the idea of the symmetry, but the pen needs to be placed exactly in the middle (more symmetry) or further to the left (rule of thirds).  You are also not using the whole file size that you could''ve, I''m wondering whether that could''ve gotten rid of some of the compression artifacts, or whether it was just the light conditions and the camera...', '2002-06-17 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74736, 2526, 441, '<td valign="top">only 70Kb submitted here - your allowed 150Kb - post in the Q &amp; A forum to find out how. your pic needs an upright(portrait) format rather than the landscape format you have chosen.</td>', 'only 70Kb submitted here - your allowed 150Kb - post in the Q & A forum to find out how. your pic needs an upright(portrait) format rather than the landscape format you have chosen.', '2002-06-17 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74737, 2526, 2158, '<td valign="top">The shadows don''t really stand out enough to have any impact.</td>', 'The shadows don''t really stand out enough to have any impact.', '2002-06-17 20:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74738, 2526, 1759, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept, but to me this looks like more of a starting point. You might find an object that presents something a bit more interesting for the viewer and then work on the lighting a bit more.</td>', 'An interesting concept, but to me this looks like more of a starting point. You might find an object that presents something a bit more interesting for the viewer and then work on the lighting a bit more.', '2002-06-17 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74739, 2526, 2312, '<td valign="top">Would be more effective with more defined shadows.</td>', 'Would be more effective with more defined shadows.', '2002-06-19 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74740, 2526, 811, '<td valign="top">I think this picture could be made better by doing couple of things.  My first impression is either it needs to be center more exactly or just to the left a little.  Also, if the background was a different color, there may have been more contrast and the shadows a little more visible.</td>', 'I think this picture could be made better by doing couple of things.  My first impression is either it needs to be center more exactly or just to the left a little.  Also, if the background was a different color, there may have been more contrast and the shadows a little more visible.', '2002-06-21 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74741, 2526, 1599, '<td valign="top">What is that a photo of?  Eyeliner?</td>', 'What is that a photo of?  Eyeliner?', '2002-06-21 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74742, 2526, 1, '<td valign="top">Not exactly appealing.  try centering the pen and adding more light.</td>', 'Not exactly appealing.  try centering the pen and adding more light.', '2002-06-22 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74743, 2527, 718, '<td valign="top">Great pic!</td>', 'Great pic!', '2002-06-17 01:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74744, 2527, 1054, '<td valign="top">The angle and framing don''t quite work for me here... too much dead space.</td>', 'The angle and framing don''t quite work for me here... too much dead space.', '2002-06-17 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74745, 2527, 1944, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. I like the texture on the Ellie Phunt''s back and the way the light dies off on the right. It would have been nice if you could have controled the light source a little more and not burned out the top of his (her) head.</td>', 'Interesting concept. I like the texture on the Ellie Phunt''s back and the way the light dies off on the right. It would have been nice if you could have controled the light source a little more and not burned out the top of his (her) head.', '2002-06-17 02:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74746, 2527, 1707, '<td valign="top">neat concept but maybe a softer light?</td>', 'neat concept but maybe a softer light?', '2002-06-17 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74747, 2527, 2000, '<td valign="top">glare on elephant''s head is a bit bright.</td>', 'glare on elephant''s head is a bit bright.', '2002-06-17 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74748, 2527, 2199, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice composition.', '2002-06-17 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74749, 2527, 1759, '<td valign="top">Ellie is a nice elephant and she makes a nice shadow. I like that the way you''ve set up the light makes it look like a sunset against the shadow. Too bad it blows out the highlights on her head, but I don''t see how you could avoid that without a double exposure and photoshop magic or some such arrangement. Good going.</td>', 'Ellie is a nice elephant and she makes a nice shadow. I like that the way you''ve set up the light makes it look like a sunset against the shadow. Too bad it blows out the highlights on her head, but I don''t see how you could avoid that without a double exposure and photoshop magic or some such arrangement. Good going.', '2002-06-18 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74750, 2527, 1175, '<td valign="top">This is the bomb photo this week.  I really love it.  I hope others love it as much as I do.  YOU''VE GOT A 10 MR/MS</td>', 'This is the bomb photo this week.  I really love it.  I hope others love it as much as I do.  YOU''VE GOT A 10 MR/MS', '2002-06-18 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74751, 2527, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of light to create this shadow... good shot!</td>', 'Excellent use of light to create this shadow... good shot!', '2002-06-18 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74752, 2527, 2217, '<td valign="top">lovely composition.  Catchy.</td>', 'lovely composition.  Catchy.', '2002-06-19 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74753, 2527, 2125, '<td valign="top">cute title<br/></td>', 'cute title', '2002-06-20 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74754, 2527, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow, small nit:  light is a little overly bright on his head, back half of it.  Photo 8 Creativity 7 Shadows 8 total 8</td>', 'Nice shadow, small nit:  light is a little overly bright on his head, back half of it.  Photo 8 Creativity 7 Shadows 8 total 8', '2002-06-21 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74755, 2527, 1, '<td valign="top">I think the spot light would have been better off on the elephant, rather than half elephant + half wall.</td>', 'I think the spot light would have been better off on the elephant, rather than half elephant + half wall.', '2002-06-23 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74756, 2527, 661, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on this one.  Good definition on the subject and shadow.</td>', 'I like the lighting on this one.  Good definition on the subject and shadow.', '2002-06-24 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74757, 2527, 1175, '<td valign="top">This was a great photo.  It was one of my 10s.  Some poeple just don''t get it.</td>', 'This was a great photo.  It was one of my 10s.  Some poeple just don''t get it.', '2002-06-24 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(74758, 2528, 1175, '<td valign="top">The background is WAY over exposed and detracts from the overall photo.</td>', 'The background is WAY over exposed and detracts from the overall photo.', '2002-06-17 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74759, 2528, 917, '<td valign="top">Before clicking, I run through a mental checklist, one item being ''Am I holding the camera straight?''</td>', 'Before clicking, I run through a mental checklist, one item being ''Am I holding the camera straight?''', '2002-06-17 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74760, 2528, 741, '<td valign="top">Left hand side is way over exposed.  This might have been deliberate but I think it''s just too much.</td>', 'Left hand side is way over exposed.  This might have been deliberate but I think it''s just too much.', '2002-06-17 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74761, 2528, 570, '<td valign="top">looks like she''s running for a hotdog to me.</td>', 'looks like she''s running for a hotdog to me.', '2002-06-17 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74762, 2528, 1759, '<td valign="top">It has a shadow and it has a subject, but a very loose connection with the challenge. I like the angle for the composition, but am not so sure about the washed out look. It does force one''s attention directly to the subject, which is very good. I think that this would have worked well for on the road, but I''m just not sure about the shadow.</td>', 'It has a shadow and it has a subject, but a very loose connection with the challenge. I like the angle for the composition, but am not so sure about the washed out look. It does force one''s attention directly to the subject, which is very good. I think that this would have worked well for on the road, but I''m just not sure about the shadow.', '2002-06-17 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74763, 2528, 2172, '<td valign="top">Can''t decide if I like the overexposure</td>', 'Can''t decide if I like the overexposure', '2002-06-17 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74764, 2528, 772, '<td valign="top">I see the shadows in this photo, yet they are not adding anything interesting or special to the overall impact of the image...  The left half of this image is also quite over exposed...  With ''shadows'' being the subject of this challenge, I feel that the shadows should be playing some definite role in the image...</td>', 'I see the shadows in this photo, yet they are not adding anything interesting or special to the overall impact of the image...  The left half of this image is also quite over exposed...  With ''shadows'' being the subject of this challenge, I feel that the shadows should be playing some definite role in the image...', '2002-06-17 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74765, 2528, 1313, '<td valign="top">Looks faded too busy</td>', 'Looks faded too busy', '2002-06-17 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74766, 2528, 2109, '<td valign="top">holy overexposure batman!  Nice effect, but perhaps in the wrong photo</td>', 'holy overexposure batman!  Nice effect, but perhaps in the wrong photo', '2002-06-17 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74767, 2528, 1856, '<td valign="top">Isn''t she already in the shade?  The washout down the street is really distracting...doesn''t add anything to the photo for me.  The red and white ''cones'' would make for an interesting photo.</td>', 'Isn''t she already in the shade?  The washout down the street is really distracting...doesn''t add anything to the photo for me.  The red and white ''cones'' would make for an interesting photo.', '2002-06-18 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74768, 2528, 1, '<td valign="top">Cool shot though I seriously don''t understand how you were able to pull it off.  Reminds me of the Nike commercial.</td>', 'Cool shot though I seriously don''t understand how you were able to pull it off.  Reminds me of the Nike commercial.', '2002-06-18 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74769, 2528, 1908, '<td valign="top">to washed out, light to bright</td>', 'to washed out, light to bright', '2002-06-18 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74770, 2528, 1054, '<td valign="top">The top left corner of this image is overly bright on my screen, and the whole image seems tilted slightly left.</td>', 'The top left corner of this image is overly bright on my screen, and the whole image seems tilted slightly left.', '2002-06-18 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74771, 2528, 1793, '<td valign="top">i think this would be better if she were in the sun running for shade. the background is too blown out - compose and meter the scene that you''re going to shoot.</td>', 'i think this would be better if she were in the sun running for shade. the background is too blown out - compose and meter the scene that you''re going to shoot.', '2002-06-19 02:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74772, 2528, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, looks like a colorized movie still.  The whole left side is washed out, I probably would have given you a much better score if you would have cropped it out, as the right side is much more viewable.  Photo 3 Creativity 5 Shadows 4 total 4</td>', 'Interesting effect, looks like a colorized movie still.  The whole left side is washed out, I probably would have given you a much better score if you would have cropped it out, as the right side is much more viewable.  Photo 3 Creativity 5 Shadows 4 total 4', '2002-06-19 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74773, 2528, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like this :). Interesting overexposure effect. Only the things in shade exist. It''s the way I feel on a really bright, glary day.</td>', 'I like this :). Interesting overexposure effect. Only the things in shade exist. It''s the way I feel on a really bright, glary day.', '2002-06-19 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74774, 2528, 1993, '<td valign="top">I wish the photo didn''t fade out to white so much in the back....but the brilliant colors of the markers with the yellow objects in the distance are a nice contrast.</td>', 'I wish the photo didn''t fade out to white so much in the back....but the brilliant colors of the markers with the yellow objects in the distance are a nice contrast.', '2002-06-20 03:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74775, 2528, 1599, '<td valign="top">I like this shot alot!</td>', 'I like this shot alot!', '2002-06-21 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74776, 2528, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the saturated reds going down the mddle of the road.  It draws your attention so you can find the runner.  Also, I like the way the right side is washed out, becasue it looks he/she is running into nothingness.  Having said that, I wish the shadows had been a bit more dramatic.</td>', 'I really like the saturated reds going down the mddle of the road.  It draws your attention so you can find the runner.  Also, I like the way the right side is washed out, becasue it looks he/she is running into nothingness.  Having said that, I wish the shadows had been a bit more dramatic.', '2002-06-23 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74777, 2528, 656, '<td valign="top">very stark - the red &amp; white works well</td>', 'very stark - the red & white works well', '2002-06-24 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74778, 2529, 718, '<td valign="top">I like the title.</td>', 'I like the title.', '2002-06-17 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74779, 2529, 1856, '<td valign="top">Would have been more striking had the background color under the water been uniform.  The brownish blob is distracting.  If it was possible to get a clear shadow of all of the fingers, that would have been an improvement too.</td>', 'Would have been more striking had the background color under the water been uniform.  The brownish blob is distracting.  If it was possible to get a clear shadow of all of the fingers, that would have been an improvement too.', '2002-06-17 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74780, 2529, 1175, '<td valign="top">abstract.  Weeiiirrrd.</td>', 'abstract.  Weeiiirrrd.', '2002-06-17 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74781, 2529, 1599, '<td valign="top">This is different.</td>', 'This is different.', '2002-06-18 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74782, 2529, 1054, '<td valign="top">I think the hand is actually a distraction here, I wonder if it would have been possible to do something with just the play of shadow and light through the ripples... maybe with a rubber duck or something that it looked like it belonged there to provide a focal point.</td>', 'I think the hand is actually a distraction here, I wonder if it would have been possible to do something with just the play of shadow and light through the ripples... maybe with a rubber duck or something that it looked like it belonged there to provide a focal point.', '2002-06-18 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74783, 2529, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice water play!  Great look and effect.  Photo 9 Creativity 8 Shadows 9 total 9</td>', 'Nice water play!  Great look and effect.  Photo 9 Creativity 8 Shadows 9 total 9', '2002-06-18 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74784, 2529, 1759, '<td valign="top">I find this visually interesting. It makes me ponder, what am I looking at? The exposure seems a bit noisy and not real sharp, which detracts a bit from the overall quality. Nonetheless, an original artistic idea.</td>', 'I find this visually interesting. It makes me ponder, what am I looking at? The exposure seems a bit noisy and not real sharp, which detracts a bit from the overall quality. Nonetheless, an original artistic idea.', '2002-06-18 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
