(74792, 2529, 661, '<td valign="top">Trippy photo.  I don''t know if it was more focused if this would make it better or worse.  Intesting to look at though.</td>', 'Trippy photo.  I don''t know if it was more focused if this would make it better or worse.  Intesting to look at though.', '2002-06-24 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
