(74797, 2530, 772, '<td valign="top">I think the ''glare'' is distracting from any shadow that may be visible in this image... Maybe a glare is an ''anti-shadow''??</td>', 'I think the ''glare'' is distracting from any shadow that may be visible in this image... Maybe a glare is an ''anti-shadow''??', '2002-06-17 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
