(74810, 2530, 811, '<td valign="top">I can see a shadow, sortof, from top to bottom.  I''m not too sure how to improve it.  It looks like it was shot straight on, so maybe a different angle or perspective?  Also, cropping so the corner can''t be seen on the left, maybe.</td>', 'I can see a shadow, sortof, from top to bottom.  I''m not too sure how to improve it.  It looks like it was shot straight on, so maybe a different angle or perspective?  Also, cropping so the corner can''t be seen on the left, maybe.', '2002-06-19 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1);
