(74903, 2534, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully executed image... I *love* the contast between the red rose, the dark shadows, and the white background.. I envy those of you who do well with white backgrounds... that has been an area I have avoided and i really need to work on it some... It takes more time and patience than I am usually willing to give to get these images just right...  I love the diagonal orientations in this photo also... I''m a sucker for the strong diagonals.  I am trying to decide how much i like the blurred shadow.. i think it works very well here but I would also like to see the same image with a more defined sharp shadow...  I don''t see any reason that this photo should not receive a 10 :)  Great work!</td>', 'This is a beautifully executed image... I *love* the contast between the red rose, the dark shadows, and the white background.. I envy those of you who do well with white backgrounds... that has been an area I have avoided and i really need to work on it some... It takes more time and patience than I am usually willing to give to get these images just right...  I love the diagonal orientations in this photo also... I''m a sucker for the strong diagonals.  I am trying to decide how much i like the blurred shadow.. i think it works very well here but I would also like to see the same image with a more defined sharp shadow...  I don''t see any reason that this photo should not receive a 10 :)  Great work!', '2002-06-17 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74904, 2534, 933, '<td valign="top">Excellent image.  Would have been improved I think if you brought out the red a bit more in the flower, and adjusted the white point on the background to make it a more pure white.  Also, when optimizing and saving your image, you really should take advantage of the full 150k file size available to you.  I think using a little less compression would have resulted in a slightly crisper, brighter image.  But all in all, a really nice composition.  Very well done.</td>', 'Excellent image.  Would have been improved I think if you brought out the red a bit more in the flower, and adjusted the white point on the background to make it a more pure white.  Also, when optimizing and saving your image, you really should take advantage of the full 150k file size available to you.  I think using a little less compression would have resulted in a slightly crisper, brighter image.  But all in all, a really nice composition.  Very well done.', '2002-06-17 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74905, 2534, 1759, '<td valign="top">I almost used this theme. This turned out nice with only one dissenting comment. I wish you could have gotten rid of the shadow from the rose. I wonder if a finely focused directional source light from the left would do the trick. Maybe use a snoot or barn doors. Anyway, I liked this photo and think it very good.</td>', 'I almost used this theme. This turned out nice with only one dissenting comment. I wish you could have gotten rid of the shadow from the rose. I wonder if a finely focused directional source light from the left would do the trick. Maybe use a snoot or barn doors. Anyway, I liked this photo and think it very good.', '2002-06-17 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(74906, 2534, 2109, '<td valign="top">nice effect!  This would be a 10 if you altered the camera or lighting angles to hide the real shadow beneath the rose, leaving only the opposite shadow.   Very good photo</td>', 'nice effect!  This would be a 10 if you altered the camera or lighting angles to hide the real shadow beneath the rose, leaving only the opposite shadow.   Very good photo', '2002-06-17 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
