(74953, 2537, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I might not be able to read the shadow Bud, but the Millennium certainly comes through.  I like the dark to light shadow transition, but I think it goes to far in the light direction on the left side of this shot.  Sometimes wish the site would matte our photos with other than white, but it would probably hurt other people''s photos.  I also like the stray accents, like the two in the middle of the shadow and the one at the bottom.  <br/>Obviously serious attempt to meet the challenge.  Thank you.  Photo 9 Creativity 10 Shadows 9 total 9</td>', 'Very nice.  I might not be able to read the shadow Bud, but the Millennium certainly comes through.  I like the dark to light shadow transition, but I think it goes to far in the light direction on the left side of this shot.  Sometimes wish the site would matte our photos with other than white, but it would probably hurt other people''s photos.  I also like the stray accents, like the two in the middle of the shadow and the one at the bottom.  Obviously serious attempt to meet the challenge.  Thank you.  Photo 9 Creativity 10 Shadows 9 total 9', '2002-06-21 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
