(75088, 2547, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, beautiful cat.  VERY MINOR NIT:  unshadowed side of face, in the cheek area has a silvery tint.  I get that too often myself with very white subjects in direct sunlight.  No suggestions, just try fiddling with the camera settings until it goes away.  (It is a very small, practically unnoticable defect.)  Photo 9 Creativity 6 Shadows 7 total 8 (some may grade you down due to the shadow enhanses the cat and not the other way around)</td>', 'Very nice photo, beautiful cat.  VERY MINOR NIT:  unshadowed side of face, in the cheek area has a silvery tint.  I get that too often myself with very white subjects in direct sunlight.  No suggestions, just try fiddling with the camera settings until it goes away.  (It is a very small, practically unnoticable defect.)  Photo 9 Creativity 6 Shadows 7 total 8 (some may grade you down due to the shadow enhanses the cat and not the other way around)', '2002-06-17 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
