(75174, 2554, 1061, '<td valign="top">Thats a bath sponge, you twit!</td>', 'Thats a bath sponge, you twit!', '2002-06-23 05:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75175, 2554, 313, '<td valign="top">this is my favorite shot of the week, but i think the shadow aspect of it is pretty weak.</td>', 'this is my favorite shot of the week, but i think the shadow aspect of it is pretty weak.', '2002-06-23 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75176, 2554, 1066, '<td valign="top">Thanks for voting.<br/><br/>If you looked at my photo outtakes you could see I had lots of obvious cast shadow pictures.  What I saw in this shot was what happens when shadows within the contour of an object transform what we see into something neat..like turning a bath sponge into a delicate rose with petals.<br/><br/>The reflection on the surface of the bathtub is just that..A reflection and was not supposed to be considered the shadow element.  The shadow play ''INSIDE'' the sponge makes the edges into petals and the Depth of Field within the "Rose".<br/><br/>Anyway, just another way to look at what is a shadow.<br/><br/></td>', 'Thanks for voting.If you looked at my photo outtakes you could see I had lots of obvious cast shadow pictures.  What I saw in this shot was what happens when shadows within the contour of an object transform what we see into something neat..like turning a bath sponge into a delicate rose with petals.The reflection on the surface of the bathtub is just that..A reflection and was not supposed to be considered the shadow element.  The shadow play ''INSIDE'' the sponge makes the edges into petals and the Depth of Field within the "Rose".Anyway, just another way to look at what is a shadow.', '2002-06-24 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(75177, 2555, 2075, '<td valign="top">WOW. I really love the composition here!</td>', 'WOW. I really love the composition here!', '2002-06-17 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75178, 2555, 2000, '<td valign="top">I see a man-made eclipse in your future.  I like that mountain in the shadow.</td>', 'I see a man-made eclipse in your future.  I like that mountain in the shadow.', '2002-06-17 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75179, 2555, 1658, '<td valign="top">Nicely done shot.</td>', 'Nicely done shot.', '2002-06-17 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75180, 2555, 1877, '<td valign="top">Ooh it looks like a sunset in mountains!</td>', 'Ooh it looks like a sunset in mountains!', '2002-06-17 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75181, 2555, 1820, '<td valign="top">I think it is too bright on the crystal ball.  Since the subject is shadow, you probably can just focus on the shadow without including the entire crystal ball.</td>', 'I think it is too bright on the crystal ball.  Since the subject is shadow, you probably can just focus on the shadow without including the entire crystal ball.', '2002-06-17 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75182, 2555, 2172, '<td valign="top">Different - but nice</td>', 'Different - but nice', '2002-06-17 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75183, 2555, 1897, '<td valign="top">a little washed out, need an interesting background, this is too smooth</td>', 'a little washed out, need an interesting background, this is too smooth', '2002-06-17 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75184, 2555, 2109, '<td valign="top">superb</td>', 'superb', '2002-06-17 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75185, 2555, 1759, '<td valign="top">How did you do this? It is very interesting.</td>', 'How did you do this? It is very interesting.', '2002-06-17 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75186, 2555, 1599, '<td valign="top">ok</td>', 'ok', '2002-06-18 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75187, 2555, 1944, '<td valign="top">Nice simple design. Good execution of the shadow concept.</td>', 'Nice simple design. Good execution of the shadow concept.', '2002-06-19 00:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75188, 2555, 527, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is really cool. It''s abstract and familiar, bold and somehow comforting. Maybe that''s the power of crystal. It''s hard to go wrong with crystal.</td>', 'Wow, this is really cool. It''s abstract and familiar, bold and somehow comforting. Maybe that''s the power of crystal. It''s hard to go wrong with crystal.', '2002-06-19 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75189, 2555, 2221, '<td valign="top">very nice! on of my favourites this challenge.</td>', 'very nice! on of my favourites this challenge.', '2002-06-19 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75190, 2555, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely composition... I love the lighting and shadow effects on this photo.  My only minor complaint on this photo is that I think it needs just a little bit more breathing room on the top and bottom of the frame.  i think the same amount that you have on the left would be great on the top and bottom as well... excellent shot! = 9</td>', 'This is a lovely composition... I love the lighting and shadow effects on this photo.  My only minor complaint on this photo is that I think it needs just a little bit more breathing room on the top and bottom of the frame.  i think the same amount that you have on the left would be great on the top and bottom as well... excellent shot! = 9', '2002-06-19 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75191, 2555, 693, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot.  i like the reflection of the shadow back onto the ball.  The only thing that takes away from the shot is the overall brightness of the highlights.  I don''t know how one would make it softer looking (maybe with the use of a flash/light deflector) but that would improve the mood.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot.  i like the reflection of the shadow back onto the ball.  The only thing that takes away from the shot is the overall brightness of the highlights.  I don''t know how one would make it softer looking (maybe with the use of a flash/light deflector) but that would improve the mood.', '2002-06-19 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75192, 2555, 472, '<td valign="top">weird.  but cool.</td>', 'weird.  but cool.', '2002-06-19 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75193, 2555, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I''m not sure what else to say. Yet another to go in my 10s!</td>', 'Beautiful! I''m not sure what else to say. Yet another to go in my 10s!', '2002-06-20 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75194, 2555, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool effect.  I like how the light radiates like a sunflower.  This reminds me of a sylized sun rising over a mountain top.  Really nice.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 9 Shadows 9 total 9</td>', 'Cool effect.  I like how the light radiates like a sunflower.  This reminds me of a sylized sun rising over a mountain top.  Really nice.Photo 9 Creativity 9 Shadows 9 total 9', '2002-06-21 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75195, 2555, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed and shot.</td>', 'Nicely framed and shot.', '2002-06-21 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75196, 2555, 1061, '<td valign="top">Very cool, nice idea!</td>', 'Very cool, nice idea!', '2002-06-23 04:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75197, 2555, 1042, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot to me. I love the way the shadow looks like it has a "sunrise" coming up over a "mountain". I can look at it again and see the iris of an eye with the light spot being the pupil. I think the photo is centered well and it''s just interesting to view. I also think the sepia tone was perfect for this. Not too harsh. Softens it just enough. :)</td>', 'This is a really cool shot to me. I love the way the shadow looks like it has a "sunrise" coming up over a "mountain". I can look at it again and see the iris of an eye with the light spot being the pupil. I think the photo is centered well and it''s just interesting to view. I also think the sepia tone was perfect for this. Not too harsh. Softens it just enough. :)', '2002-06-23 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75198, 2555, 1454, '<td valign="top">Nice effect!</td>', 'Nice effect!', '2002-06-23 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75199, 2555, 312, '<td valign="top">neat shadow. good composition and lighting. i dig.</td>', 'neat shadow. good composition and lighting. i dig.', '2002-06-24 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75200, 2555, 661, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture.  Fun to look at.</td>', 'Very interesting picture.  Fun to look at.', '2002-06-24 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75201, 2557, 2075, '<td valign="top">More of a refraction image than "shadow" to me.</td>', 'More of a refraction image than "shadow" to me.', '2002-06-17 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75202, 2557, 1041, '<td valign="top">I see where you are trying to go with this one, but unfortunately, this is very much a gray on gray shot.  Some more contrast, and maybe a stronger lightsource could''ve helped IMO.</td>', 'I see where you are trying to go with this one, but unfortunately, this is very much a gray on gray shot.  Some more contrast, and maybe a stronger lightsource could''ve helped IMO.', '2002-06-17 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75203, 2557, 203, '<td valign="top">Grrrrrrrrrrrrrrraaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaayyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyy!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Grrrrrrrrrrrrrrraaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaayyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyy!!!!!!!!', '2002-06-17 19:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75204, 2557, 1296, '<td valign="top">more contrast</td>', 'more contrast', '2002-06-18 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75205, 2557, 1054, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the way this is divided in the middle, sorry.</td>', 'I don''t like the way this is divided in the middle, sorry.', '2002-06-18 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75206, 2557, 1569, '<td valign="top">More contrast is needed--everything looks washed out and dull.</td>', 'More contrast is needed--everything looks washed out and dull.', '2002-06-18 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75207, 2557, 1944, '<td valign="top">I like the play of the light as it''s reflected through the marbles. The ''carpers'' are probably asking where the shadow is but it works for me.</td>', 'I like the play of the light as it''s reflected through the marbles. The ''carpers'' are probably asking where the shadow is but it works for me.', '2002-06-19 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75208, 2557, 2221, '<td valign="top">a little less contrast for my taste.</td>', 'a little less contrast for my taste.', '2002-06-19 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75209, 2557, 2199, '<td valign="top">I like this photo; shapes and lighting effects. Did you experiment with placing the "divider" somewhere other than the middle of the photo? It seems a little too symetrical to place this so close to the middle...</td>', 'I like this photo; shapes and lighting effects. Did you experiment with placing the "divider" somewhere other than the middle of the photo? It seems a little too symetrical to place this so close to the middle...', '2002-06-19 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75210, 2557, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice shadows!  i think this would have also been nice with some colored lighting possibly :)  The could have also produce some neat effects if lit by candle.  The only flaw I see that really catches my eye is the diagonal shadow line across the lower left of the frame.  Maybe a tighter crop?  Good work! - jmsetzler</td>', 'Very nice shadows!  i think this would have also been nice with some colored lighting possibly :)  The could have also produce some neat effects if lit by candle.  The only flaw I see that really catches my eye is the diagonal shadow line across the lower left of the frame.  Maybe a tighter crop?  Good work! - jmsetzler', '2002-06-19 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75211, 2557, 2314, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast<br/></td>', 'Needs more contrast', '2002-06-19 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(75212, 2557, 142, '<td valign="top">Simply marbleous!</td>', 'Simply marbleous!', '2002-06-19 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75213, 2557, 1721, '<td valign="top">took me a minute to figure it out.. but I like it.. I think it needs more contrast though</td>', 'took me a minute to figure it out.. but I like it.. I think it needs more contrast though', '2002-06-20 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75214, 2557, 1993, '<td valign="top">You made me have to look real hard for the shadows...but that''s OK.  Nice shot.  I like the trunk-like composition as well.</td>', 'You made me have to look real hard for the shadows...but that''s OK.  Nice shot.  I like the trunk-like composition as well.', '2002-06-20 02:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75215, 2557, 641, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this.. but maybe could use just a little more contrast.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this.. but maybe could use just a little more contrast.', '2002-06-21 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75216, 2557, 1599, '<td valign="top">Interesting</td>', 'Interesting', '2002-06-21 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75217, 2557, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but poorly executed.  Not sure if black and white fits it.  Try to alter your lighting for a more dramatic effect.</td>', 'Nice idea, but poorly executed.  Not sure if black and white fits it.  Try to alter your lighting for a more dramatic effect.', '2002-06-22 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75218, 2557, 2172, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of your comments.  Uh, I think it needed a little more, oh I don''t know, CONTRAST.   For my first entry, I''ll take the 4.3.</td>', 'Thanks for all of your comments.  Uh, I think it needed a little more, oh I don''t know, CONTRAST.   For my first entry, I''ll take the 4.3.', '2002-06-30 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(75219, 2558, 2075, '<td valign="top">Nice idea here. Excellent composition, sharpness and detail.</td>', 'Nice idea here. Excellent composition, sharpness and detail.', '2002-06-17 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75220, 2558, 1856, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but not the composition.  I had a hard time figure out how to position the shadow and object in my photo too.  I think that''s the hardest part of the challenge!</td>', 'I like the idea but not the composition.  I had a hard time figure out how to position the shadow and object in my photo too.  I think that''s the hardest part of the challenge!', '2002-06-17 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75221, 2558, 142, '<td valign="top">I love this!  You get a perfect 10 from me.</td>', 'I love this!  You get a perfect 10 from me.', '2002-06-17 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75222, 2558, 616, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. I just wish that one of the dead flowers wasn''t lying down. It is somewhat distracting and it also takes away from that great shadow.</td>', 'I like this a lot. I just wish that one of the dead flowers wasn''t lying down. It is somewhat distracting and it also takes away from that great shadow.', '2002-06-17 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75223, 2558, 570, '<td valign="top">pretty good.</td>', 'pretty good.', '2002-06-17 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75224, 2558, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool flowers, I really like the starkness of this shot.  Why the stem on the table (not in the glass)?<br/>Photo 10 Creativity 9 Shadows 9 total 9</td>', 'Cool flowers, I really like the starkness of this shot.  Why the stem on the table (not in the glass)?Photo 10 Creativity 9 Shadows 9 total 9', '2002-06-17 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75225, 2558, 327, '<td valign="top">lol Done well, good job, good light, composition, SUPER!!</td>', 'lol Done well, good job, good light, composition, SUPER!!', '2002-06-17 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75226, 2558, 2172, '<td valign="top">So smooth - made me look twice - I like it</td>', 'So smooth - made me look twice - I like it', '2002-06-17 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75227, 2558, 933, '<td valign="top">I really like this image very much.  Very crisp &amp; clean, nice composition.  Adding the flower along with the shadow really made the difference - makes it a much more interesting photo imho.  Good job!</td>', 'I really like this image very much.  Very crisp & clean, nice composition.  Adding the flower along with the shadow really made the difference - makes it a much more interesting photo imho.  Good job!', '2002-06-17 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75228, 2558, 2109, '<td valign="top">very nice!  Indoor or outdoor?</td>', 'very nice!  Indoor or outdoor?', '2002-06-17 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75229, 2558, 1054, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of shadows, excellent composition and negative space.  The inclusion of the flower lying on the shadow gives that little extra.</td>', 'Excellent use of shadows, excellent composition and negative space.  The inclusion of the flower lying on the shadow gives that little extra.', '2002-06-17 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75230, 2558, 2199, '<td valign="top">very nice composition!</td>', 'very nice composition!', '2002-06-17 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75231, 2558, 2, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Your wonderful textures and lighting have acheived the sense of depth that reallly makes the shot.</td>', 'Great shot.  Your wonderful textures and lighting have acheived the sense of depth that reallly makes the shot.', '2002-06-17 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75232, 2558, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good job on this one. I like the simplicity and I think that the thistles on the left help break up the monotony of the shadow and add more interest to the overall photo. The angle of the bottle seems a bit wierd to me, but you''re the phototographer, you control the horozontal and the vertical so do what looks good to you. Again, good job!</td>', 'Good job on this one. I like the simplicity and I think that the thistles on the left help break up the monotony of the shadow and add more interest to the overall photo. The angle of the bottle seems a bit wierd to me, but you''re the phototographer, you control the horozontal and the vertical so do what looks good to you. Again, good job!', '2002-06-17 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75233, 2558, 1585, '<td valign="top">I like this. You must be one of the good photographers.</td>', 'I like this. You must be one of the good photographers.', '2002-06-17 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75234, 2558, 1599, '<td valign="top">Is this Moon Flower pods?</td>', 'Is this Moon Flower pods?', '2002-06-18 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75235, 2558, 1882, '<td valign="top">Now, THAT''s a nice shot.</td>', 'Now, THAT''s a nice shot.', '2002-06-18 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75236, 2558, 2123, '<td valign="top">I like this!  For some reason my brain wants the vase in the lower right and the flowers in upper left, though.</td>', 'I like this!  For some reason my brain wants the vase in the lower right and the flowers in upper left, though.', '2002-06-18 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75237, 2558, 1175, '<td valign="top">Great angle and subject for your shadow.  I can''t help but wish would it would look like without the flower on the ground.  I may have liked it more.</td>', 'Great angle and subject for your shadow.  I can''t help but wish would it would look like without the flower on the ground.  I may have liked it more.', '2002-06-18 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75238, 2558, 554, '<td valign="top">this is a quality shot---thanks for spending the time---10</td>', 'this is a quality shot---thanks for spending the time---10', '2002-06-18 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75239, 2558, 2152, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more I like it.  Good job keeping the white so white.  Might be a little overshaprened though.  Great work.</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more I like it.  Good job keeping the white so white.  Might be a little overshaprened though.  Great work.', '2002-06-18 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75240, 2558, 875, '<td valign="top">Great idea - clean-looking with wonderful framing - a perfect photo.  My favorite photo of the week.</td>', 'Great idea - clean-looking with wonderful framing - a perfect photo.  My favorite photo of the week.', '2002-06-19 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75241, 2558, 1944, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of your picture, and you executed it very well. The buds in the shadow give a good effect. The only 10 I''m giving this week.</td>', 'I really like the concept of your picture, and you executed it very well. The buds in the shadow give a good effect. The only 10 I''m giving this week.', '2002-06-19 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75242, 2558, 693, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this photo... white background and nothing to distract the viewer.  I really like the fact that you''ve placed a lone branch/twig on the shadow itself to separate this photo from all the other flower/vase photos.  I like the way your mind works.  My only 10 ever!</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this photo... white background and nothing to distract the viewer.  I really like the fact that you''ve placed a lone branch/twig on the shadow itself to separate this photo from all the other flower/vase photos.  I like the way your mind works.  My only 10 ever!', '2002-06-19 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75243, 2558, 2173, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2002-06-19 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75244, 2558, 1820, '<td valign="top">Well thought out!  Very creative!!!  Good one!</td>', 'Well thought out!  Very creative!!!  Good one!', '2002-06-19 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75245, 2558, 2091, '<td valign="top">Very Nice :)</td>', 'Very Nice :)', '2002-06-19 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75246, 2558, 811, '<td valign="top">This strikes me on two levels.  First, it looks like I am your gardener.  Every plant in my house is either dead, or well on its way in that direction.  Secondly, I would have never though of putting the flower in the shadow like you did.  Good job.</td>', 'This strikes me on two levels.  First, it looks like I am your gardener.  Every plant in my house is either dead, or well on its way in that direction.  Secondly, I would have never though of putting the flower in the shadow like you did.  Good job.', '2002-06-19 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75247, 2558, 1993, '<td valign="top">I like your shot, a lot.  Even the title made me giggle.  (most of them don''t)</td>', 'I like your shot, a lot.  Even the title made me giggle.  (most of them don''t)', '2002-06-20 02:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75248, 2558, 2110, '<td valign="top">Nice composition! I like the subject and minimal amount of color that makes this image a visually soothing shot!</td>', 'Nice composition! I like the subject and minimal amount of color that makes this image a visually soothing shot!', '2002-06-20 07:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75249, 2558, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great idea, beautifully composed. The "hair" is a nice element that creates a very interesting shadow.</td>', 'Great idea, beautifully composed. The "hair" is a nice element that creates a very interesting shadow.', '2002-06-20 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75250, 2558, 737, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you mixed the shadows and the flowers. Creative</td>', 'I really like the way you mixed the shadows and the flowers. Creative', '2002-06-20 12:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75251, 2558, 772, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites this week for sure... The depth of field is phenomenal and i really love the touch of adding an extra ''weed'' or whatever this is into the shadow... I wish I could make photos this nice... great shot! = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is one of my favorites this week for sure... The depth of field is phenomenal and i really love the touch of adding an extra ''weed'' or whatever this is into the shadow... I wish I could make photos this nice... great shot! = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-20 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75252, 2558, 2263, '<td valign="top">Is this digital?</td>', 'Is this digital?', '2002-06-20 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75253, 2558, 885, '<td valign="top">why the real one on the surface?  i think i''d have liked it better without</td>', 'why the real one on the surface?  i think i''d have liked it better without', '2002-06-21 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75254, 2558, 2079, '<td valign="top">This silly weed has more hair than I do (but I didn''t dock you for it) - Great compesition and creativity. - 10</td>', 'This silly weed has more hair than I do (but I didn''t dock you for it) - Great compesition and creativity. - 10', '2002-06-23 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75255, 2558, 1061, '<td valign="top">This is art</td>', 'This is art', '2002-06-23 04:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75256, 2558, 1, '<td valign="top">Great shot, awesome framing.  I don''t know why you laid the one down on the shadow though, it seems to distract from the image... i''d like to see the shot without it.</td>', 'Great shot, awesome framing.  I don''t know why you laid the one down on the shadow though, it seems to distract from the image... i''d like to see the shot without it.', '2002-06-23 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75257, 2558, 772, '<td valign="top">Congrats on second :)  Great photo and well deserved ribbon :)</td>', 'Congrats on second :)  Great photo and well deserved ribbon :)', '2002-06-24 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(75258, 2558, 1569, '<td valign="top">Congratulations---great picture!!!</td>', 'Congratulations---great picture!!!', '2002-06-24 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(75259, 2558, 1859, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite photo from last week!  Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'This was my favorite photo from last week!  Congrats on your ribbon!', '2002-06-24 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(75260, 2558, 1041, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments and votes! :)  I was going to post a version of the shot w/out the additional onion weed in the shadow (this is by far the most common critique I got), but it seems that I deleted the gazillions of other variations I had of this shot when I tried to clean up my photos.  Sorry.<br/><br/>Anyway, I did that, as well as turning the shadow to be the vertical object to try and put the emphasis on the shadow first, and the bottle &amp; weeds second.<br/><br/>Btw, these weeds actually look that way, they are not dead! ;)</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments and votes! :)  I was going to post a version of the shot w/out the additional onion weed in the shadow (this is by far the most common critique I got), but it seems that I deleted the gazillions of other variations I had of this shot when I tried to clean up my photos.  Sorry.Anyway, I did that, as well as turning the shadow to be the vertical object to try and put the emphasis on the shadow first, and the bottle & weeds second.Btw, these weeds actually look that way, they are not dead! ;)', '2002-06-24 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(75261, 2558, 1042, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10..it''s a great shot and I remember distinctly that I commented on it.Yet I can''t see my comment. Did I dream that part? lol..I don''t know but I loved this shot and I had made a comment on how much I liked the idea of the one weed laying on the shadow.  Congrats!</td>', 'I gave this a 10..it''s a great shot and I remember distinctly that I commented on it.Yet I can''t see my comment. Did I dream that part? lol..I don''t know but I loved this shot and I had made a comment on how much I liked the idea of the one weed laying on the shadow.  Congrats!', '2002-06-24 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(75262, 2558, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, you have earned this award!! Congrats to you.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, you have earned this award!! Congrats to you.', '2002-06-24 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
