(75339, 2563, 1005, '<td valign="top">This shot was taken in my garage.  I used a hologen light to create the shadows.  I needed the light another 5 or 6 feet further away to get the shadows with less distortion, but I couldn''t get the lamp that far away, too short of a cord and NO grounded extension cord, bummer.  The elves were from a metal garden cut out and the extra stuff was a potted tansey.<br/>I was trying to give the effect of a moonlit dance.  After much thought, I wish I had included a small, round mirror (to emulate the moon) and glitter for a little sparkle, but hindsight and all.  Thanks for the comments.</td>', 'This shot was taken in my garage.  I used a hologen light to create the shadows.  I needed the light another 5 or 6 feet further away to get the shadows with less distortion, but I couldn''t get the lamp that far away, too short of a cord and NO grounded extension cord, bummer.  The elves were from a metal garden cut out and the extra stuff was a potted tansey.I was trying to give the effect of a moonlit dance.  After much thought, I wish I had included a small, round mirror (to emulate the moon) and glitter for a little sparkle, but hindsight and all.  Thanks for the comments.', '2002-06-24 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(75340, 2565, 2075, '<td valign="top">This feels more like refraction of light, than of shadow to me.</td>', 'This feels more like refraction of light, than of shadow to me.', '2002-06-17 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
