(75350, 2565, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice chandellier.  Might have been better with out the light source, in my opinion.  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Shadows 8 total 8</td>', 'Nice chandellier.  Might have been better with out the light source, in my opinion.  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Shadows 8 total 8', '2002-06-18 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75351, 2565, 2009, '<td valign="top">Clever and lovely.</td>', 'Clever and lovely.', '2002-06-18 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75352, 2565, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I was going to submit one like this with a candle carousel thing but strangely simply forgot the idea.  Anyway, good composition.</td>', 'Nice job.  I was going to submit one like this with a candle carousel thing but strangely simply forgot the idea.  Anyway, good composition.', '2002-06-18 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75353, 2565, 2158, '<td valign="top">Unusual to have shadows that are light.  I like it.</td>', 'Unusual to have shadows that are light.  I like it.', '2002-06-18 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75354, 2565, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very cool  patterns. It''s an interesting light, but I think the composition could have been stronger if you just cropped it down and showed part of the light and its patterns on the ceiling and cut out the walls.</td>', 'Very cool  patterns. It''s an interesting light, but I think the composition could have been stronger if you just cropped it down and showed part of the light and its patterns on the ceiling and cut out the walls.', '2002-06-19 03:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75355, 2565, 2217, '<td valign="top">lovely photo.  Good shadows.</td>', 'lovely photo.  Good shadows.', '2002-06-19 07:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75356, 2565, 2221, '<td valign="top">nice! the lamp looks a bit pressed to the lower border.</td>', 'nice! the lamp looks a bit pressed to the lower border.', '2002-06-19 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75357, 2565, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the shadows cast by this light fixture... i wish there would have been some way to capture this without having the walls and molding in the image... - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like the shadows cast by this light fixture... i wish there would have been some way to capture this without having the walls and molding in the image... - jmsetzler', '2002-06-19 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75358, 2565, 2312, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting demonstration of light reflection and refraction. I think the photo would have more impact with some slight underexposure.</td>', 'This is an interesting demonstration of light reflection and refraction. I think the photo would have more impact with some slight underexposure.', '2002-06-19 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75359, 2565, 570, '<td valign="top">looks very stupid if you ask me</td>', 'looks very stupid if you ask me', '2002-06-20 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75360, 2565, 641, '<td valign="top">what a play of light. If it weren''t for the baseboards in the shot it would be better.</td>', 'what a play of light. If it weren''t for the baseboards in the shot it would be better.', '2002-06-21 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75361, 2565, 1, '<td valign="top">nicely shot, twould be nice to see a directly upwards shot.</td>', 'nicely shot, twould be nice to see a directly upwards shot.', '2002-06-21 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75362, 2565, 811, '<td valign="top">I think cropping this, or taking the picture may have made it more interesting.  Also, I tried a shot very similar to this, and I found out that if I adjusted the contrast and brightness a bit, I could get some really deep shadows around the edges, adn that may have eliminated the trim where the ceiling meets the wall.</td>', 'I think cropping this, or taking the picture may have made it more interesting.  Also, I tried a shot very similar to this, and I found out that if I adjusted the contrast and brightness a bit, I could get some really deep shadows around the edges, adn that may have eliminated the trim where the ceiling meets the wall.', '2002-06-23 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75363, 2567, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good shot, I wish the horizon had been above top-of frame, or alternately lower in the shot.  Being just in the frame is distracting to me.</td>', 'Good shot, I wish the horizon had been above top-of frame, or alternately lower in the shot.  Being just in the frame is distracting to me.', '2002-06-17 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75364, 2567, 2193, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field...</td>', 'Nice depth of field...', '2002-06-17 03:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75365, 2567, 1759, '<td valign="top">How I wish we were not limited to the 4:3 aspect ratio. This is very good and would be better if you could crop the top off, but you would need to do so without loosing the sides darn it! I gave this a very high score because it demonstrates such an unusual view of a simple common pattern. The angle and focal length are just right. The front (bottom) looks slightly out of focus, which is the only thing I can see that might be improved. Very good job on this one.</td>', 'How I wish we were not limited to the 4:3 aspect ratio. This is very good and would be better if you could crop the top off, but you would need to do so without loosing the sides darn it! I gave this a very high score because it demonstrates such an unusual view of a simple common pattern. The angle and focal length are just right. The front (bottom) looks slightly out of focus, which is the only thing I can see that might be improved. Very good job on this one.', '2002-06-17 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75366, 2567, 1897, '<td valign="top">well executed, interesting focus point</td>', 'well executed, interesting focus point', '2002-06-17 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75367, 2567, 1009, '<td valign="top">Wow... this photo is great!</td>', 'Wow... this photo is great!', '2002-06-17 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75368, 2567, 2, '<td valign="top">The _slight_ rotation to the right is just a little distracting, though I think the curves of the fence magnify that more than is actually the case.  Great use of crisp lines and shapes.</td>', 'The _slight_ rotation to the right is just a little distracting, though I think the curves of the fence magnify that more than is actually the case.  Great use of crisp lines and shapes.', '2002-06-17 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75369, 2567, 1666, '<td valign="top">I like the way that you have reflected the pattern of the shadow, with the symetry of your framing. The low angle works great. In my top 10!</td>', 'I like the way that you have reflected the pattern of the shadow, with the symetry of your framing. The low angle works great. In my top 10!', '2002-06-17 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75370, 2567, 1792, '<td valign="top">Good expression of the theme combined with simplicity and good composition.</td>', 'Good expression of the theme combined with simplicity and good composition.', '2002-06-18 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75371, 2567, 1599, '<td valign="top">DIFFERENT</td>', 'DIFFERENT', '2002-06-18 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75372, 2567, 2235, '<td valign="top">Not really sure this fits theme for shadows. Good framing and exposure. B&amp;W works well with this subject.</td>', 'Not really sure this fits theme for shadows. Good framing and exposure. B&W works well with this subject.', '2002-06-18 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75373, 2567, 1658, '<td valign="top">very well balanced.  I like your choice of where the focus is.</td>', 'very well balanced.  I like your choice of where the focus is.', '2002-06-18 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75374, 2567, 1569, '<td valign="top">This one''s really neat---more depth  of field is needed. Just my slant.</td>', 'This one''s really neat---more depth  of field is needed. Just my slant.', '2002-06-18 19:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75375, 2567, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent angle on this shot and good use of shadows :)  I like the sharp contrast created by the shadows here.... The depth of field is definitely visible here.. you can actually see where it comes and goes :)  good shot!</td>', 'Excellent angle on this shot and good use of shadows :)  I like the sharp contrast created by the shadows here.... The depth of field is definitely visible here.. you can actually see where it comes and goes :)  good shot!', '2002-06-18 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75376, 2567, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, bold photo.</td>', 'Very interesting, bold photo.', '2002-06-19 05:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75377, 2567, 737, '<td valign="top">Good composition and use of light. Well above average.</td>', 'Good composition and use of light. Well above average.', '2002-06-20 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75378, 2567, 573, '<td valign="top">Wow! Textures and patterns with high contrast and shalow depth of field grab my attention every time, nicely done.</td>', 'Wow! Textures and patterns with high contrast and shalow depth of field grab my attention every time, nicely done.', '2002-06-20 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75379, 2567, 875, '<td valign="top">I love the band of focus across the photo and the texture.  I think I''d like to see a little more of the background at the top.</td>', 'I love the band of focus across the photo and the texture.  I think I''d like to see a little more of the background at the top.', '2002-06-20 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75380, 2567, 2210, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Like the view</td>', 'Great perspective. Like the view', '2002-06-21 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75381, 2567, 244, '<td valign="top">Great clairity and good fulfillment of the challenge.  I love the repeating pattern  Score 7 ------- Corey</td>', 'Great clairity and good fulfillment of the challenge.  I love the repeating pattern  Score 7 ------- Corey', '2002-06-22 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75382, 2567, 2079, '<td valign="top">The contrast in this shadow is superb - I like the perspective.</td>', 'The contrast in this shadow is superb - I like the perspective.', '2002-06-23 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75383, 2567, 1128, '<td valign="top">Very clever title!</td>', 'Very clever title!', '2002-06-23 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75384, 2567, 1, '<td valign="top">Superb composure, I definitely like seeing the end of it (at the top).</td>', 'Superb composure, I definitely like seeing the end of it (at the top).', '2002-06-23 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75385, 2568, 593, '<td valign="top">Pretty. I wish I could tell what it is - is it a stage?</td>', 'Pretty. I wish I could tell what it is - is it a stage?', '2002-06-17 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75386, 2568, 1897, '<td valign="top">I do not see a point of interest.</td>', 'I do not see a point of interest.', '2002-06-17 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75387, 2568, 1944, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. Well done.</td>', 'Interesting concept. Well done.', '2002-06-17 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75388, 2568, 2243, '<td valign="top">Little too much blackness on top, but I like the lights</td>', 'Little too much blackness on top, but I like the lights', '2002-06-17 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75389, 2568, 2235, '<td valign="top">Too much wasted space. Good shot and contrast.</td>', 'Too much wasted space. Good shot and contrast.', '2002-06-18 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75390, 2568, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but difficult to view/interpret what one is viewing.  Photo 7 Creativity 8 Shadows 7 total 7</td>', 'Interesting, but difficult to view/interpret what one is viewing.  Photo 7 Creativity 8 Shadows 7 total 7', '2002-06-18 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75391, 2568, 1054, '<td valign="top">I wish the crop were tighter on this image.</td>', 'I wish the crop were tighter on this image.', '2002-06-18 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75392, 2568, 772, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite determine what I''m looking at in this photo but the light effects are definitely nice.  The framing has me a little concerned maybe... I''m not sure why the lighting is placed in the lower right quadrant of the photo... maybe a crop or more zoom or centering up would help?  I''m not sure what the circumstances were with this shot...</td>', 'I can''t quite determine what I''m looking at in this photo but the light effects are definitely nice.  The framing has me a little concerned maybe... I''m not sure why the lighting is placed in the lower right quadrant of the photo... maybe a crop or more zoom or centering up would help?  I''m not sure what the circumstances were with this shot...', '2002-06-18 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75393, 2568, 2247, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  This pic has a mystery to it that makes me wonder what''s happening.</td>', 'Interesting.  This pic has a mystery to it that makes me wonder what''s happening.', '2002-06-18 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75394, 2568, 2221, '<td valign="top">some would say it''s too dark and too much negative space but i like it very much. the topic was "shadows" so it fits perfectly.</td>', 'some would say it''s too dark and too much negative space but i like it very much. the topic was "shadows" so it fits perfectly.', '2002-06-19 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75395, 2568, 1783, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I like how the lights seems to be floating.</td>', 'Nice picture.  I like how the lights seems to be floating.', '2002-06-19 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75396, 2568, 1599, '<td valign="top">What is that a picture of?   Very different!  Wish I knew what it was.</td>', 'What is that a picture of?   Very different!  Wish I knew what it was.', '2002-06-21 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75397, 2568, 1061, '<td valign="top">Looks like a scene out of ''Close Encounters of the Third Kind''... interesting</td>', 'Looks like a scene out of ''Close Encounters of the Third Kind''... interesting', '2002-06-23 05:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75398, 2569, 2075, '<td valign="top">I like the forboding shadows here. This image implies to me that there is inevitable doom coming to the dark side. I think, however, the angle of the Knight could be stronger...perhaps pointing more towards the right?</td>', 'I like the forboding shadows here. This image implies to me that there is inevitable doom coming to the dark side. I think, however, the angle of the Knight could be stronger...perhaps pointing more towards the right?', '2002-06-17 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75399, 2569, 2123, '<td valign="top">points since it was one of my original ideas ;-)</td>', 'points since it was one of my original ideas ;-)', '2002-06-17 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75400, 2569, 570, '<td valign="top">dumb</td>', 'dumb', '2002-06-17 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75401, 2569, 2172, '<td valign="top">Makes you look twice - nice.</td>', 'Makes you look twice - nice.', '2002-06-17 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75402, 2569, 1944, '<td valign="top">Could have been a bit sharper in the foreground. Pallette is a little uninteresting.</td>', 'Could have been a bit sharper in the foreground. Pallette is a little uninteresting.', '2002-06-17 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75403, 2569, 1759, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of composition on this one. It is a nice setup that works well with the title. It might work better using a higher f-stop to keep things in focus. As it is, the viewer''s attention is drawn to the knight in the foreground. Of course, that does lead next to the queen''s shadow, so maybe not.</td>', 'I like the angle of composition on this one. It is a nice setup that works well with the title. It might work better using a higher f-stop to keep things in focus. As it is, the viewer''s attention is drawn to the knight in the foreground. Of course, that does lead next to the queen''s shadow, so maybe not.', '2002-06-17 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75404, 2569, 2235, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Good use of light and shadows along with dramatic style chess pieces</td>', 'Nice idea. Good use of light and shadows along with dramatic style chess pieces', '2002-06-17 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75405, 2569, 1599, '<td valign="top">You are right, she is in the shadows, and so am I when it come to this picture</td>', 'You are right, she is in the shadows, and so am I when it come to this picture', '2002-06-18 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75406, 2569, 1446, '<td valign="top">Cleaver title, Focus seems a little soft.</td>', 'Cleaver title, Focus seems a little soft.', '2002-06-18 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75407, 2569, 1054, '<td valign="top">It took me a moment to understand the significance of the title.  NIcely done!</td>', 'It took me a moment to understand the significance of the title.  NIcely done!', '2002-06-18 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75408, 2569, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, very subtle.  (Good title)  Photo 10 Creativity 8 Shadows 9 total 9</td>', 'Nice lighting, very subtle.  (Good title)  Photo 10 Creativity 8 Shadows 9 total 9', '2002-06-18 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75409, 2569, 1856, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Would have scored higher for me if there was a bit more color to compliment the bronze (tinted light or wall color maybe?)....or maybe as a black and white?  Could also be more focus on the King.  I wish we had re-do''s so I could see this again after you re-worked it based on input.</td>', 'Nice concept.  Would have scored higher for me if there was a bit more color to compliment the bronze (tinted light or wall color maybe?)....or maybe as a black and white?  Could also be more focus on the King.  I wish we had re-do''s so I could see this again after you re-worked it based on input.', '2002-06-18 23:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75410, 2569, 2217, '<td valign="top">Touch on the dark side, perhaps more contrast needed.  Interesting though.</td>', 'Touch on the dark side, perhaps more contrast needed.  Interesting though.', '2002-06-19 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75411, 2569, 2199, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea (I''m a chess fan too). I wonder if you experimented with creating a harder shadow -- maybe closer to the chess board? How would this look if the shadows were darker and more menacing?</td>', 'Interesting idea (I''m a chess fan too). I wonder if you experimented with creating a harder shadow -- maybe closer to the chess board? How would this look if the shadows were darker and more menacing?', '2002-06-19 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(75412, 2569, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I wish the Knight was turne a little more to show its nice profile... good work! - jmsetzler</td>', 'Nice shot!  I wish the Knight was turne a little more to show its nice profile... good work! - jmsetzler', '2002-06-19 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75413, 2569, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like this one more and more.  The chess pieces are nice, and I like the warm glow of light on them.  I wish you''d got the king in focus, too, but I know the DOF is often limited when doing these kind of macro shots.  Also like that the shadows are obviously not the same pieces and don''t match up one by one.</td>', 'I like this one more and more.  The chess pieces are nice, and I like the warm glow of light on them.  I wish you''d got the king in focus, too, but I know the DOF is often limited when doing these kind of macro shots.  Also like that the shadows are obviously not the same pieces and don''t match up one by one.', '2002-06-22 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75414, 2569, 1, '<td valign="top">I think you would''ve been better off showing the sahdow of the rook as well.</td>', 'I think you would''ve been better off showing the sahdow of the rook as well.', '2002-06-23 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75415, 2569, 47, '<td valign="top">i would have voted higher if the queen''s shadow was darker than the rest of the peices, and was in better focus, as its the point of your shot according to the title.</td>', 'i would have voted higher if the queen''s shadow was darker than the rest of the peices, and was in better focus, as its the point of your shot according to the title.', '2002-06-26 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(75416, 2570, 2243, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but better if the second glass was showing more than just its base</td>', 'Nice idea, but better if the second glass was showing more than just its base', '2002-06-17 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75417, 2570, 1856, '<td valign="top">Good idea but I think you could have taken a few more shots to get the composition worked out.  There''s too much going on with shadows and reflections overlapping.</td>', 'Good idea but I think you could have taken a few more shots to get the composition worked out.  There''s too much going on with shadows and reflections overlapping.', '2002-06-17 23:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75418, 2570, 983, '<td valign="top">The reflection is too much... would be a better shot with either the reflections or the shadows. still above average though. <br/></td>', 'The reflection is too much... would be a better shot with either the reflections or the shadows. still above average though. ', '2002-06-18 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75419, 2570, 1759, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea! I think that this simple arrangement works. Not a complaint, but I''m wondering if you tried using a polarizer to eliminate the reflections and if so did it help or hinder the photo?</td>', 'Wonderful idea! I think that this simple arrangement works. Not a complaint, but I''m wondering if you tried using a polarizer to eliminate the reflections and if so did it help or hinder the photo?', '2002-06-18 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75420, 2570, 1054, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the reflections and the shadow through the glasses.</td>', 'I like the effect of the reflections and the shadow through the glasses.', '2002-06-18 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75421, 2570, 554, '<td valign="top">very nicely done---well framed for the shadow and also a quality shot--9</td>', 'very nicely done---well framed for the shadow and also a quality shot--9', '2002-06-18 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75422, 2570, 718, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and textures.</td>', 'Nice angle and textures.', '2002-06-18 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75423, 2570, 1944, '<td valign="top">Interesting shadow photo. I think it would have been a little better if you didn''t have the reflections of the glasses on the glass, possibly by changing the camera angle or with a polarizer.</td>', 'Interesting shadow photo. I think it would have been a little better if you didn''t have the reflections of the glasses on the glass, possibly by changing the camera angle or with a polarizer.', '2002-06-19 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75424, 2570, 2110, '<td valign="top">I like the composition- a frame of shadow in the frame,  what disturbs me a little about this frame is that the perspective of the objects and the shadows are contrary to each other, creating a little confusion to my eyes.</td>', 'I like the composition- a frame of shadow in the frame,  what disturbs me a little about this frame is that the perspective of the objects and the shadows are contrary to each other, creating a little confusion to my eyes.', '2002-06-19 06:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75425, 2570, 2199, '<td valign="top">wow! very nice.....I like the overall effect you''ve achieved with the glasses, table and position of the shadows. Three different planes to view is also unique (reflections in the glass table, the items on the table, the shadows and floor below the table)</td>', 'wow! very nice.....I like the overall effect you''ve achieved with the glasses, table and position of the shadows. Three different planes to view is also unique (reflections in the glass table, the items on the table, the shadows and floor below the table)', '2002-06-19 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75426, 2570, 772, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!  I like the shadows and the reflections here... good work!  - jmsetzler</td>', 'Very interesting!  I like the shadows and the reflections here... good work!  - jmsetzler', '2002-06-20 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75427, 2570, 1599, '<td valign="top">Different</td>', 'Different', '2002-06-21 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75428, 2570, 689, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflections ...</td>', 'Interesting reflections ...', '2002-06-21 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75429, 2570, 1, '<td valign="top">The reflections from the sun/flash don''t do this image any justice.</td>', 'The reflections from the sun/flash don''t do this image any justice.', '2002-06-21 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75430, 2570, 156, '<td valign="top">I wanted to portray these shadows, this situation, exactly as i saw them/it (albeit a narrower field of view) ...i could have used the polarizer but that would have destroyed the "exactly as i saw it" look i was going for...because it was on a glass topped table, of course there would be reflections</td>', 'I wanted to portray these shadows, this situation, exactly as i saw them/it (albeit a narrower field of view) ...i could have used the polarizer but that would have destroyed the "exactly as i saw it" look i was going for...because it was on a glass topped table, of course there would be reflections', '2002-06-24 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(75431, 2571, 1759, '<td valign="top">I see a cute cat and a nice pose. Interesting lighting on the cat, but it doesn''t cast a very good shadow. I think this may have worked better with a different angle for the lighting. The striped floor is an interesting background, perhaps a long shadow down the length of the blinds?</td>', 'I see a cute cat and a nice pose. Interesting lighting on the cat, but it doesn''t cast a very good shadow. I think this may have worked better with a different angle for the lighting. The striped floor is an interesting background, perhaps a long shadow down the length of the blinds?', '2002-06-17 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75432, 2571, 1944, '<td valign="top">Nice cat shot. You skillfully told your story.</td>', 'Nice cat shot. You skillfully told your story.', '2002-06-17 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75433, 2571, 203, '<td valign="top">Nice snap shot.  I can tell you love your cat.</td>', 'Nice snap shot.  I can tell you love your cat.', '2002-06-17 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75434, 2571, 2109, '<td valign="top">here kitty kitty</td>', 'here kitty kitty', '2002-06-17 19:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75435, 2571, 2235, '<td valign="top">Good use of B&amp;W to bring out tones. Well done, excellent sharpness. Fine detail</td>', 'Good use of B&W to bring out tones. Well done, excellent sharpness. Fine detail', '2002-06-18 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75436, 2571, 1054, '<td valign="top">The shadow makes it look likt the cat is in jail... cute.</td>', 'The shadow makes it look likt the cat is in jail... cute.', '2002-06-18 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75437, 2571, 1831, '<td valign="top">Great composition, Great photo, Great use of B &amp; W. "9" Dogman:-)</td>', 'Great composition, Great photo, Great use of B & W. "9" Dogman:-)', '2002-06-18 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75438, 2571, 772, '<td valign="top">Lovely black and white!  The shadows here are excellent as well... good shot!</td>', 'Lovely black and white!  The shadows here are excellent as well... good shot!', '2002-06-18 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75439, 2571, 2217, '<td valign="top">Great picture</td>', 'Great picture', '2002-06-19 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75440, 2571, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the nicest cat photos I''ve seen on DPC. It''s a great portrait, in that I can see so much personality in it :). The light picks up the fur so nicely, and the black and white works well. The shadows are like the bars of a prison. I love it!</td>', 'I think this is one of the nicest cat photos I''ve seen on DPC. It''s a great portrait, in that I can see so much personality in it :). The light picks up the fur so nicely, and the black and white works well. The shadows are like the bars of a prison. I love it!', '2002-06-19 08:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75441, 2571, 2199, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. Don''t know where to start as I like so much here....pattern on the floor, position of the cat in the photo....the blotch of light on the far left...very nice.</td>', 'Excellent photo. Don''t know where to start as I like so much here....pattern on the floor, position of the cat in the photo....the blotch of light on the far left...very nice.', '2002-06-19 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75442, 2571, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I for one really like pictures of cats.  My only suggestion would be to try to get the cat more to the left (not far) so that it has more room to "look."  Beautiful cat, by theway.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I for one really like pictures of cats.  My only suggestion would be to try to get the cat more to the left (not far) so that it has more room to "look."  Beautiful cat, by theway.', '2002-06-20 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
