(75463, 2572, 244, '<td valign="top">Nice feel to this shot, and very cool lamp, let me know where to get one.  I think the slanted black line on the right hand side is a little distracting.  With the background it looks like it is in a window, but    unless it is a really crooked window sill it coudn''t be that way.   Score 7 --------- Corey</td>', 'Nice feel to this shot, and very cool lamp, let me know where to get one.  I think the slanted black line on the right hand side is a little distracting.  With the background it looks like it is in a window, but    unless it is a really crooked window sill it coudn''t be that way.   Score 7 --------- Corey', '2002-06-22 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75464, 2572, 715, '<td valign="top">Very good composition and colors,  but the reflections (or smkoke)  on the left and the top of the photo are disturbing though.</td>', 'Very good composition and colors,  but the reflections (or smkoke)  on the left and the top of the photo are disturbing though.', '2002-06-23 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75465, 2572, 1, '<td valign="top">Pretty interesting looking image.. it has a lot to offer, can''t wait for a howto.</td>', 'Pretty interesting looking image.. it has a lot to offer, can''t wait for a howto.', '2002-06-23 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75466, 2572, 715, '<td valign="top">Should have done much better then 95th place, but I guess a lot of voters didn''t think it was a shadow. Otherwise I can''t explain all the low votes.<br/>BTW I just realized that Camel is a sigaretbrand, so I wonder if it actually is smoke and if you put it in on purpose?</td>', 'Should have done much better then 95th place, but I guess a lot of voters didn''t think it was a shadow. Otherwise I can''t explain all the low votes.BTW I just realized that Camel is a sigaretbrand, so I wonder if it actually is smoke and if you put it in on purpose?', '2002-06-24 10:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(75467, 2572, 472, '<td valign="top">yeah the ''its not a shadow'' was a major factor, according to like 1/2 the comments.  also maybe there is anti-middle eastern sentiment floating around?  the smoke was from incense and i was trying to get it thick enough so the light beams from the candle shined through, but it just kind of wafted around .. : )</td>', 'yeah the ''its not a shadow'' was a major factor, according to like 1/2 the comments.  also maybe there is anti-middle eastern sentiment floating around?  the smoke was from incense and i was trying to get it thick enough so the light beams from the candle shined through, but it just kind of wafted around .. : )', '2002-06-24 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
