(75475, 2573, 2110, '<td valign="top">nice thought.. but contrary to life. It is a shadow of life on the dead. If were the shadow of the of the dead faling on something newly born, it would have completed the cycle. life after death! If you menat something different, please share with me.</td>', 'nice thought.. but contrary to life. It is a shadow of life on the dead. If were the shadow of the of the dead faling on something newly born, it would have completed the cycle. life after death! If you menat something different, please share with me.', '2002-06-19 05:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
