(75506, 2576, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very cool shadow idea.  Was there a way of having at least one of the 3s the right way around?  Also, the 3 and some of the background is slightly blown out, and why is one of them gray?  Regardless, a really good entry for this challenge.</td>', 'Very cool shadow idea.  Was there a way of having at least one of the 3s the right way around?  Also, the 3 and some of the background is slightly blown out, and why is one of them gray?  Regardless, a really good entry for this challenge.', '2002-06-18 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
