(75509, 2576, 715, '<td valign="top">Fascinating photo, I wonder how you did this.<br/>I would have liked it even better if the structure of the background at the top-right would not be visible,  like the other part  on the right.</td>', 'Fascinating photo, I wonder how you did this.I would have liked it even better if the structure of the background at the top-right would not be visible,  like the other part  on the right.', '2002-06-19 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75510, 2576, 772, '<td valign="top">Ok.. i''m stumped on this one... I love it but I can''t figger out exactly how it was done :)  I''ll not ponder on that and I''ll just enjoy the composition here :)  Maybe I will ponder... hmm... there''s a ''perspective'' issue in this photo that is buggin me :)  I am wondering if some of the ''prop'' here may be artificial.. Hmm.. anyway.. i love it!  Great work! = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'Ok.. i''m stumped on this one... I love it but I can''t figger out exactly how it was done :)  I''ll not ponder on that and I''ll just enjoy the composition here :)  Maybe I will ponder... hmm... there''s a ''perspective'' issue in this photo that is buggin me :)  I am wondering if some of the ''prop'' here may be artificial.. Hmm.. anyway.. i love it!  Great work! = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-19 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75511, 2576, 811, '<td valign="top">Very nice and simplistic.  I like it.</td>', 'Very nice and simplistic.  I like it.', '2002-06-20 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
