(75513, 2576, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice black and white, interesting idea. The composition is strong. I really like the shadows that mobiles create, and it''s nice to see photos like this one playing with that effect (if that''s what it is... maybe it isn''t, but I''m interpreting it that way... things suspended in the air).</td>', 'Very nice black and white, interesting idea. The composition is strong. I really like the shadows that mobiles create, and it''s nice to see photos like this one playing with that effect (if that''s what it is... maybe it isn''t, but I''m interpreting it that way... things suspended in the air).', '2002-06-20 08:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
