(75523, 2576, 332, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments.<br/><br/>The first thing I did was cutting out some numbers I printed. I used both black and white paper. Then I hung the numbers with a extra thin string. I used only one light source to get this result. I was afraid that I would see the string but with some level adjustment it just disappeared.<br/><br/>I took about 40 or 50 shots and picked one. I was doing this only hours before the deadline.</td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments.The first thing I did was cutting out some numbers I printed. I used both black and white paper. Then I hung the numbers with a extra thin string. I used only one light source to get this result. I was afraid that I would see the string but with some level adjustment it just disappeared.I took about 40 or 50 shots and picked one. I was doing this only hours before the deadline.', '2002-06-28 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(75524, 2577, 1054, '<td valign="top">Strong blues and good range of light.</td>', 'Strong blues and good range of light.', '2002-06-17 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
