(75536, 2577, 2312, '<td valign="top">Nice use of contrast.</td>', 'Nice use of contrast.', '2002-06-19 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75537, 2577, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a beautify mixed cloud, sky shot.  Good colors and textures.  I had initially scored you as a 6, but after reading the forum discussions on sillhouettes vs. shadows, you got lucky and go up.  I am going to go out on a limb and say "sillhouettes are shadows from the ''other'' side".  (The sun rays at the bottom are a nifty effect, if possible, include them more, it adds extra zing to the shot.  (Gives it that "holy" look for the religously zealot)  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Shadows 8 total 8<br/>(see you did go up!!)</td>', 'This is a beautify mixed cloud, sky shot.  Good colors and textures.  I had initially scored you as a 6, but after reading the forum discussions on sillhouettes vs. shadows, you got lucky and go up.  I am going to go out on a limb and say "sillhouettes are shadows from the ''other'' side".  (The sun rays at the bottom are a nifty effect, if possible, include them more, it adds extra zing to the shot.  (Gives it that "holy" look for the religously zealot)  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Shadows 8 total 8(see you did go up!!)', '2002-06-19 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75538, 2577, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice clouds!  I wonder what this would look like with some of the ground showing... I have no idea what is underneat that but I also wonder if there would be any shadows cast by these clouds and sunlight... good shot! - jmsetzler</td>', 'Nice clouds!  I wonder what this would look like with some of the ground showing... I have no idea what is underneat that but I also wonder if there would be any shadows cast by these clouds and sunlight... good shot! - jmsetzler', '2002-06-20 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
