(75578, 2578, 312, '<td valign="top">nice shot, and nice shadows. might have benefited from a higher aperture, as the leaves look a little out of focus as they come closer to the lens. i''m also not sure i like how the right edge is cropped off of the leaves. overall, though, a nice shot.</td>', 'nice shot, and nice shadows. might have benefited from a higher aperture, as the leaves look a little out of focus as they come closer to the lens. i''m also not sure i like how the right edge is cropped off of the leaves. overall, though, a nice shot.', '2002-06-24 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
