(75702, 2586, 772, '<td valign="top">I''ll have to admit that your shadow does have some nice color :)  I''m not very impressed with theoverall concept of this photo... I believe that some additional impact could have been provided on this photo with a little different lighting setup and by applying the rule of thirds to the composition.  Maybe a closeup view of the bottle and the shadow on a vertical crop?  I think there are some possibilities here if you play with it a little :)</td>', 'I''ll have to admit that your shadow does have some nice color :)  I''m not very impressed with theoverall concept of this photo... I believe that some additional impact could have been provided on this photo with a little different lighting setup and by applying the rule of thirds to the composition.  Maybe a closeup view of the bottle and the shadow on a vertical crop?  I think there are some possibilities here if you play with it a little :)', '2002-06-17 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
