(75706, 2586, 1759, '<td valign="top">This looks like a starting point. From here you could play some more with the lighting to get rid of the glaringly bright right side (or just crop it off), find something more pleasant to look at like a glass vase from a 2nd hand store or whatever, and put something more attractive under the subject.</td>', 'This looks like a starting point. From here you could play some more with the lighting to get rid of the glaringly bright right side (or just crop it off), find something more pleasant to look at like a glass vase from a 2nd hand store or whatever, and put something more attractive under the subject.', '2002-06-17 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
