(75715, 2587, 1446, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photograph.  I wish the focus was a little harder, but the feeling of depth is very good.  Some of the things is the background are a little distracting, but not horribly so IMO.</td>', 'This is a very interesting photograph.  I wish the focus was a little harder, but the feeling of depth is very good.  Some of the things is the background are a little distracting, but not horribly so IMO.', '2002-06-17 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75716, 2587, 327, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, nice long shadows.</td>', 'Cool shot, nice long shadows.', '2002-06-17 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75717, 2587, 1054, '<td valign="top">Live framing and composition, B&amp;W was an excellent choice.</td>', 'Live framing and composition, B&W was an excellent choice.', '2002-06-17 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75718, 2587, 1944, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic design. Good use of tonalities.</td>', 'Nice graphic design. Good use of tonalities.', '2002-06-17 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75719, 2587, 2, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for geometry and shapes, and you''ve done a great job with your shot setup to give this photograph such wonderful balance.  The only thing I don''t like is that the poles in the left-middle of the photograph seem slightly out of focus, and they seem the most important to me.  Nice job, though.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for geometry and shapes, and you''ve done a great job with your shot setup to give this photograph such wonderful balance.  The only thing I don''t like is that the poles in the left-middle of the photograph seem slightly out of focus, and they seem the most important to me.  Nice job, though.', '2002-06-17 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75720, 2587, 1599, '<td valign="top">Where was this shoot?  It is ok</td>', 'Where was this shoot?  It is ok', '2002-06-18 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75721, 2587, 2235, '<td valign="top">Good use of line and convergence. Framing is well done and depth of field works well with this shot. B&amp;W also is major asset to this picture. Sky is a bit harsh but bright sky is what made the shadows.</td>', 'Good use of line and convergence. Framing is well done and depth of field works well with this shot. B&W also is major asset to this picture. Sky is a bit harsh but bright sky is what made the shadows.', '2002-06-18 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75722, 2587, 1175, '<td valign="top">The lines are great in this photo how it cruves at top comes down and then curves to the right to join up again.  Great photo.</td>', 'The lines are great in this photo how it cruves at top comes down and then curves to the right to join up again.  Great photo.', '2002-06-18 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75723, 2587, 1041, '<td valign="top">I love perspective shots like that.  B&amp;w works well.  Your posts aren''t quite vertical.  Still in my top 10 this week.</td>', 'I love perspective shots like that.  B&w works well.  Your posts aren''t quite vertical.  Still in my top 10 this week.', '2002-06-18 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75724, 2587, 2078, '<td valign="top">wow this is a beautiful shot......my fav of this challenge!!!! =)</td>', 'wow this is a beautiful shot......my fav of this challenge!!!! =)', '2002-06-19 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75725, 2587, 1793, '<td valign="top">great use of line. :)</td>', 'great use of line. :)', '2002-06-19 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75726, 2587, 2110, '<td valign="top">May be a slightly lower point of view would have allowed you more white space in the frame, and that would have emphasized the curved elements more and the top dark patch int he composition would have disturbed less.<br/>i like the shadow coming straight into the viewer, that creates a direct contact with the image.</td>', 'May be a slightly lower point of view would have allowed you more white space in the frame, and that would have emphasized the curved elements more and the top dark patch int he composition would have disturbed less.i like the shadow coming straight into the viewer, that creates a direct contact with the image.', '2002-06-19 06:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
