(75745, 2589, 1005, '<td valign="top">Brown out problems?  Very dark photo with hints of blue/grey color.  Vaguely out of focus (were you going for a soft focus shot?)  Many digital cameras (mine included) have problems with autofocus in darker conditions (IR focusing).  Try aiming at a subject in better light that is about the same distance away, lock the focus (half shutter press) then swing back to your dark subject.  It will be in focus.  Also try a looonnnggger exposure with a tripod (will capture a brighter photo)  Photo 3 Creativity 6 Shadows 6 total 4  (photo quality really hurt your score)</td>', 'Brown out problems?  Very dark photo with hints of blue/grey color.  Vaguely out of focus (were you going for a soft focus shot?)  Many digital cameras (mine included) have problems with autofocus in darker conditions (IR focusing).  Try aiming at a subject in better light that is about the same distance away, lock the focus (half shutter press) then swing back to your dark subject.  It will be in focus.  Also try a looonnnggger exposure with a tripod (will capture a brighter photo)  Photo 3 Creativity 6 Shadows 6 total 4  (photo quality really hurt your score)', '2002-06-17 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75746, 2589, 1041, '<td valign="top">Hm.  I''m sure there''s something you are trying to tell us with this shot that I''m not getting.  To me, it''s just an OOF keyboard that''s rather too dark.  Oh, yes, and it happens to have some shadows, too.  Sorry.</td>', 'Hm.  I''m sure there''s something you are trying to tell us with this shot that I''m not getting.  To me, it''s just an OOF keyboard that''s rather too dark.  Oh, yes, and it happens to have some shadows, too.  Sorry.', '2002-06-17 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75747, 2589, 772, '<td valign="top">A bit more focus and a bit mor light would have probably made this image very impressive!  I like the diagonals and i think that backlighting this shot would have provided nice shadows as well as some good contrast :)</td>', 'A bit more focus and a bit mor light would have probably made this image very impressive!  I like the diagonals and i think that backlighting this shot would have provided nice shadows as well as some good contrast :)', '2002-06-17 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
