(75770, 2590, 1005, '<td valign="top">(Golf course?)  A bit overly dark, it''s hard to make out the three from the forest (there''s a joke in there someplace!)  I like the lake/pond, it adds extra punch!  Photo 7 Creativity 6 Shadows 7 total 7</td>', '(Golf course?)  A bit overly dark, it''s hard to make out the three from the forest (there''s a joke in there someplace!)  I like the lake/pond, it adds extra punch!  Photo 7 Creativity 6 Shadows 7 total 7', '2002-06-17 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75771, 2590, 1759, '<td valign="top">¿Tres hermanos? This is dark enough that it seems to loose something. You might try shooting in raw mode if your camera supports that, or at the highest quality mode, and then adjust the gamma and/or using a histogram, adjust the levels to bring out more detail.</td>', '¿Tres hermanos? This is dark enough that it seems to loose something. You might try shooting in raw mode if your camera supports that, or at the highest quality mode, and then adjust the gamma and/or using a histogram, adjust the levels to bring out more detail.', '2002-06-17 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75772, 2590, 2235, '<td valign="top">Needed to concentrate on the bottom half of picture. Loses impact by trying to find the shadows at the bottom. Crop to bottom half.</td>', 'Needed to concentrate on the bottom half of picture. Loses impact by trying to find the shadows at the bottom. Crop to bottom half.', '2002-06-17 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75773, 2590, 1856, '<td valign="top">golf course shot?  I thought there would be more of these.  Love the color, rolling hills, and shadows...radio tower in background is slightly distracting.  I like it!</td>', 'golf course shot?  I thought there would be more of these.  Love the color, rolling hills, and shadows...radio tower in background is slightly distracting.  I like it!', '2002-06-18 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75774, 2590, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good composition and framing.  My only (minro) complaint is the antenna/tower in the background.</td>', 'Good composition and framing.  My only (minro) complaint is the antenna/tower in the background.', '2002-06-18 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75775, 2590, 1224, '<td valign="top">dark!</td>', 'dark!', '2002-06-18 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75776, 2590, 1569, '<td valign="top">Looks like the meter read the sky and not the shadows.</td>', 'Looks like the meter read the sky and not the shadows.', '2002-06-18 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75777, 2590, 2221, '<td valign="top">the three trees as the focused objects don''t have enough contrast to the forest in the back.<br/>what is that dark line on the top?</td>', 'the three trees as the focused objects don''t have enough contrast to the forest in the back.what is that dark line on the top?', '2002-06-19 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75778, 2590, 772, '<td valign="top">The scenery here is very nice... I think this photo could use a small push on the brighness dial possibly.  The subject trees are not contrasting nicely with the background.  Based on the directions of these shadows, you were shooting almost directly into the sunlight!  I don''t know if it would have been possible, but maybe another angle on these trees would have been nice :)  Good shot! - jmsetzler</td>', 'The scenery here is very nice... I think this photo could use a small push on the brighness dial possibly.  The subject trees are not contrasting nicely with the background.  Based on the directions of these shadows, you were shooting almost directly into the sunlight!  I don''t know if it would have been possible, but maybe another angle on these trees would have been nice :)  Good shot! - jmsetzler', '2002-06-19 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75779, 2590, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot and framed.</td>', 'Nicely shot and framed.', '2002-06-23 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75780, 2591, 593, '<td valign="top">Interesting. More of a reflection than a shadow.</td>', 'Interesting. More of a reflection than a shadow.', '2002-06-17 02:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75781, 2591, 327, '<td valign="top">JUST clever, creative, inventive work!!! LOL Nice job. *&amp;lt;insert clapping!!!!</td>', 'JUST clever, creative, inventive work!!! LOL Nice job. *&lt;insert clapping!!!!', '2002-06-17 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75782, 2591, 2023, '<td valign="top">I dont see a shadow i see a reflection...still a good photo.</td>', 'I dont see a shadow i see a reflection...still a good photo.', '2002-06-17 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75783, 2591, 1041, '<td valign="top">More like soul reflection.  Even though I see how you are tying this photo to the challenge, I think the challenge description was clear enough to specify that the shadow was supposed to be one of the kind that are caused by objects blocking out the light, so you didn''t really meet the challenge in my mind.  Sorry.</td>', 'More like soul reflection.  Even though I see how you are tying this photo to the challenge, I think the challenge description was clear enough to specify that the shadow was supposed to be one of the kind that are caused by objects blocking out the light, so you didn''t really meet the challenge in my mind.  Sorry.', '2002-06-17 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75784, 2591, 1563, '<td valign="top">Very good picture, Nice layout and contrast is great.  I''m giving the picture either 9 or 10</td>', 'Very good picture, Nice layout and contrast is great.  I''m giving the picture either 9 or 10', '2002-06-17 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75785, 2591, 2109, '<td valign="top">where''s the shadow?</td>', 'where''s the shadow?', '2002-06-17 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75786, 2591, 1882, '<td valign="top">took me a while to see the person.  would have liked it better if you would have shown MORE of the model.</td>', 'took me a while to see the person.  would have liked it better if you would have shown MORE of the model.', '2002-06-18 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75787, 2591, 772, '<td valign="top">This is another one of those photos where the ''shadow'' concept is way over my head.  I am too shallow-minded to uderstand how ''shadows'' ties into this theme...</td>', 'This is another one of those photos where the ''shadow'' concept is way over my head.  I am too shallow-minded to uderstand how ''shadows'' ties into this theme...', '2002-06-18 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75788, 2591, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good original photo.</td>', 'Good original photo.', '2002-06-18 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75789, 2591, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good use of reflections and shadows, and a unique interpretation.  This photo speals to the viewer and is technically excellent, so a high score.</td>', 'Good use of reflections and shadows, and a unique interpretation.  This photo speals to the viewer and is technically excellent, so a high score.', '2002-06-18 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75790, 2591, 2199, '<td valign="top">wow....intense. I had to look at this for a minute to figure out what I was seeing. I think this shadow theme has everyone on a drinking binge!</td>', 'wow....intense. I had to look at this for a minute to figure out what I was seeing. I think this shadow theme has everyone on a drinking binge!', '2002-06-19 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75791, 2591, 1, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but as for representing a shadow, it''s just not working for me.</td>', 'Great shot, but as for representing a shadow, it''s just not working for me.', '2002-06-19 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75792, 2591, 885, '<td valign="top">interesting, but i''d have shown more face, it''s a little tough to identify at first</td>', 'interesting, but i''d have shown more face, it''s a little tough to identify at first', '2002-06-21 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75793, 2593, 1031, '<td valign="top">Bonus point for alternate interpretation I didn''t think of...</td>', 'Bonus point for alternate interpretation I didn''t think of...', '2002-06-17 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75794, 2593, 2109, '<td valign="top">good FOV</td>', 'good FOV', '2002-06-17 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75795, 2593, 2, '<td valign="top">5 o''clock shadow is very clever, but without the title, this picture would lose all of its effectiveness.  I think a much closer shot to emphasize this would have been much more effective.  If you kept the current framing, at least center it horizontally.</td>', '5 o''clock shadow is very clever, but without the title, this picture would lose all of its effectiveness.  I think a much closer shot to emphasize this would have been much more effective.  If you kept the current framing, at least center it horizontally.', '2002-06-17 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75796, 2593, 1759, '<td valign="top">Okay, good tie-in with the challenge. Now, the problem is with the photo. Harsh lighting and busy background. Since the shadow is the stuff on his face, you might want to get rid of the shadow covering the eyes, or, maybe do a very close up framed as a portrait of just the chin and up almost to the eyes.</td>', 'Okay, good tie-in with the challenge. Now, the problem is with the photo. Harsh lighting and busy background. Since the shadow is the stuff on his face, you might want to get rid of the shadow covering the eyes, or, maybe do a very close up framed as a portrait of just the chin and up almost to the eyes.', '2002-06-17 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75797, 2593, 1599, '<td valign="top">ok</td>', 'ok', '2002-06-18 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75798, 2593, 1175, '<td valign="top">kinda sorta an interesting idea but overall composition is just boring.  It doesn''t do anything for me.  Try something different, more dramatic angle, i hate to say differnet lighting because your lighting was specific but it just doesn''t do anything for me.</td>', 'kinda sorta an interesting idea but overall composition is just boring.  It doesn''t do anything for me.  Try something different, more dramatic angle, i hate to say differnet lighting because your lighting was specific but it just doesn''t do anything for me.', '2002-06-18 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75799, 2593, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice double-inclusion of the theme, and good composition as well.  B/W was a good choice.</td>', 'Nice double-inclusion of the theme, and good composition as well.  B/W was a good choice.', '2002-06-18 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75800, 2593, 2221, '<td valign="top">nice. only nit is that the head is not in the middle.</td>', 'nice. only nit is that the head is not in the middle.', '2002-06-19 10:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75801, 2593, 2173, '<td valign="top">mmmmmmmmmm its fun i like it</td>', 'mmmmmmmmmm its fun i like it', '2002-06-19 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75802, 2593, 1005, '<td valign="top">Please re-read the Challenge.  Cute twist/play on words, but I''m not buying.....The shadow on the eyes kinda works, but the underside of his eyes make him look like a ghool.  Photo 6 Creativity 5 Shadows 4 total 5</td>', 'Please re-read the Challenge.  Cute twist/play on words, but I''m not buying.....The shadow on the eyes kinda works, but the underside of his eyes make him look like a ghool.  Photo 6 Creativity 5 Shadows 4 total 5', '2002-06-19 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75803, 2593, 737, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation. I think a better composition would have been just on the chin &amp; cheek, maybe with another shadow on part of the image.  Here, "Maui" is quite dominant.</td>', 'Good interpretation. I think a better composition would have been just on the chin & cheek, maybe with another shadow on part of the image.  Here, "Maui" is quite dominant.', '2002-06-20 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75804, 2593, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation :)  I believe the exposure is slightly ''warm'' on this photo.  I would also like it better if the background was a little more out of focus with a smaller depth of field.  The crop across the top cutting the top of the hat out of the frame could go either way... I''m not sure which works best, but overall, this may have worked better in a vertical orientation?  Good shot! - jmsetzler</td>', 'Nice interpretation :)  I believe the exposure is slightly ''warm'' on this photo.  I would also like it better if the background was a little more out of focus with a smaller depth of field.  The crop across the top cutting the top of the hat out of the frame could go either way... I''m not sure which works best, but overall, this may have worked better in a vertical orientation?  Good shot! - jmsetzler', '2002-06-20 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75805, 2593, 1, '<td valign="top">Eh.</td>', 'Eh.', '2002-06-23 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75806, 2593, 661, '<td valign="top">Creative take on the assignment.  To bad the picture wasn''t a little clear.  I love sharp focus.</td>', 'Creative take on the assignment.  To bad the picture wasn''t a little clear.  I love sharp focus.', '2002-06-24 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75807, 2594, 1707, '<td valign="top">good lighting - shows a mood</td>', 'good lighting - shows a mood', '2002-06-17 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75808, 2594, 2123, '<td valign="top">very pretty!</td>', 'very pretty!', '2002-06-17 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75809, 2594, 1175, '<td valign="top">looks like a dool.  very precious</td>', 'looks like a dool.  very precious', '2002-06-17 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75810, 2594, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl. Little over exposed, the tones are a bit hard, but this is a nice job. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Pretty girl. Little over exposed, the tones are a bit hard, but this is a nice job. Keep up the good work.', '2002-06-17 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75811, 2594, 570, '<td valign="top">WELCOME BACK TO 1984!</td>', 'WELCOME BACK TO 1984!', '2002-06-17 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75812, 2594, 2267, '<td valign="top">Maybe a soft focus filter would make the photo better.</td>', 'Maybe a soft focus filter would make the photo better.', '2002-06-17 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(75813, 2594, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good tonal range, I like how her hair plays with the light.</td>', 'Good tonal range, I like how her hair plays with the light.', '2002-06-17 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75814, 2594, 1856, '<td valign="top">beautiful model but I think the shadows would be more striking/dominant if she were straight haired.  The curls are distracting me from the rest of the photo.</td>', 'beautiful model but I think the shadows would be more striking/dominant if she were straight haired.  The curls are distracting me from the rest of the photo.', '2002-06-17 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75815, 2594, 1585, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.', '2002-06-17 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75816, 2594, 1485, '<td valign="top">cutie.. and great use of light / dark too.</td>', 'cutie.. and great use of light / dark too.', '2002-06-18 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75817, 2594, 1569, '<td valign="top">Love this one !!</td>', 'Love this one !!', '2002-06-18 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75818, 2594, 554, '<td valign="top">great use of shadow on this beautiful lady---10--  hand, as you know, slightly blown but her hair is perfect</td>', 'great use of shadow on this beautiful lady---10--  hand, as you know, slightly blown but her hair is perfect', '2002-06-18 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75819, 2594, 811, '<td valign="top">She looks so thoughtful.  The light may be a little bright on the left side of her face (right side of the picture), but it makes for nice contrasting shadows on the other side.</td>', 'She looks so thoughtful.  The light may be a little bright on the left side of her face (right side of the picture), but it makes for nice contrasting shadows on the other side.', '2002-06-19 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75820, 2594, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Small nit:  back of hand a bit washed out.  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Shadows 9 total 9</td>', 'Nicely done.  Small nit:  back of hand a bit washed out.  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Shadows 9 total 9', '2002-06-19 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75821, 2594, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portrait.. it does convey a little emotion here :) i would like to see a little of the right eye (her left eye) and maybe a touch of catch light in it... good work! - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a nice portrait.. it does convey a little emotion here :) i would like to see a little of the right eye (her left eye) and maybe a touch of catch light in it... good work! - jmsetzler', '2002-06-20 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75822, 2594, 2346, '<td valign="top">i really enjoyed this picture, probably because i had a similar idea when i heard about the challenge but didn''t get the picture in on time. it looks pretty natural and the tight focus brings out detail that would usually be unnoticable.The girl''s hair frames her face well and blackand white color brings out more emotion than if it had been a color photo.</td>', 'i really enjoyed this picture, probably because i had a similar idea when i heard about the challenge but didn''t get the picture in on time. it looks pretty natural and the tight focus brings out detail that would usually be unnoticable.The girl''s hair frames her face well and blackand white color brings out more emotion than if it had been a color photo.', '2002-06-21 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75823, 2594, 244, '<td valign="top">I really like this one, she looks so deep in thought, really makes me wonder what is going on in her mind.  Great use of lighting and darkness.  Very Nice!!!!   Score 8 ------ Corey</td>', 'I really like this one, she looks so deep in thought, really makes me wonder what is going on in her mind.  Great use of lighting and darkness.  Very Nice!!!!   Score 8 ------ Corey', '2002-06-22 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75824, 2594, 1, '<td valign="top">nicely lit.</td>', 'nicely lit.', '2002-06-23 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75825, 2595, 1054, '<td valign="top">I knew we''d see at least one sundial!  Well done.  I think B&amp;W might have added even more to this shot.</td>', 'I knew we''d see at least one sundial!  Well done.  I think B&W might have added even more to this shot.', '2002-06-17 01:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75826, 2595, 2109, '<td valign="top">good idea!  As far as composition goes, I would have had the center of the sundial in the upper right of the picture, and the VIII in the lower left.  Nice photo with good textures.  Looks like it would make a nice book cover.</td>', 'good idea!  As far as composition goes, I would have had the center of the sundial in the upper right of the picture, and the VIII in the lower left.  Nice photo with good textures.  Looks like it would make a nice book cover.', '2002-06-17 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75827, 2595, 117, '<td valign="top">nice conscept</td>', 'nice conscept', '2002-06-17 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75828, 2595, 2235, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Well done and very original. Lighting a bit harsh at bottom left for overall well done.</td>', 'Nice idea. Well done and very original. Lighting a bit harsh at bottom left for overall well done.', '2002-06-17 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75829, 2595, 1446, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Nicely execulted,  Great focus.  Nice framing.  Nothing I would recomend changing here.</td>', 'Great idea!  Nicely execulted,  Great focus.  Nice framing.  Nothing I would recomend changing here.', '2002-06-18 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75830, 2595, 573, '<td valign="top">The perfect subject for the shadow challenge and well done also.  In my top ten picks.</td>', 'The perfect subject for the shadow challenge and well done also.  In my top ten picks.', '2002-06-18 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75831, 2595, 1831, '<td valign="top">Good shot, Well taken, Good composition "8". Dogman:-)</td>', 'Good shot, Well taken, Good composition "8". Dogman:-)', '2002-06-18 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75832, 2595, 554, '<td valign="top">great idea-----10--textures are very nice here as well as dof---my 3rd place pick</td>', 'great idea-----10--textures are very nice here as well as dof---my 3rd place pick', '2002-06-18 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75833, 2595, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice one - you found a shadow that actually does a job!</td>', 'Nice one - you found a shadow that actually does a job!', '2002-06-18 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75834, 2595, 527, '<td valign="top">I love the idea but I''m not sure on the composition. I couldn''t know without seeing the scene in person.</td>', 'I love the idea but I''m not sure on the composition. I couldn''t know without seeing the scene in person.', '2002-06-19 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75835, 2595, 1856, '<td valign="top">Lacks interest for me.  May have been better if more of the ''hand'' was shown.  I''d like to see what created the light pattern in the big shadow.</td>', 'Lacks interest for me.  May have been better if more of the ''hand'' was shown.  I''d like to see what created the light pattern in the big shadow.', '2002-06-19 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75836, 2595, 2319, '<td valign="top">Time is always not enough. But it''s great</td>', 'Time is always not enough. But it''s great', '2002-06-20 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75837, 2595, 1037, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Very strong composition. Worth a 10, I think.</td>', 'Excellent! Very strong composition. Worth a 10, I think.', '2002-06-20 07:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75838, 2595, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I think this is one of the more unique shadows I have witnessed this week.  I like the strong diagonal... good work! - jmsetzler</td>', 'Very nice!  I think this is one of the more unique shadows I have witnessed this week.  I like the strong diagonal... good work! - jmsetzler', '2002-06-20 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75839, 2595, 1, '<td valign="top">Great framing, just enought to be creative and still tell what we''re looking at.</td>', 'Great framing, just enought to be creative and still tell what we''re looking at.', '2002-06-23 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75840, 2596, 1983, '<td valign="top">I almost entered the same type of photo...nice pic.</td>', 'I almost entered the same type of photo...nice pic.', '2002-06-17 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75841, 2596, 2123, '<td valign="top">the arm and leg are distracting...all or none would have been better</td>', 'the arm and leg are distracting...all or none would have been better', '2002-06-17 02:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75842, 2596, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice framing.</td>', 'Nice framing.', '2002-06-17 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75843, 2596, 1759, '<td valign="top">Three shadows and two subjects. I''m sorry, but this just doesn''t work for me largely because of the photographer''s shadow in the photo.</td>', 'Three shadows and two subjects. I''m sorry, but this just doesn''t work for me largely because of the photographer''s shadow in the photo.', '2002-06-17 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75844, 2596, 2199, '<td valign="top">Nice! I really like how the color elements creep in from both sides of the photo -- with shadow elements in the middle. very nice.</td>', 'Nice! I really like how the color elements creep in from both sides of the photo -- with shadow elements in the middle. very nice.', '2002-06-17 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75845, 2596, 1599, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2002-06-18 02:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75846, 2596, 1882, '<td valign="top">Ok, yeah,  you fit the challenge.  There are a few shadows.  But there is nothing artistic, clever, or thought provoking about this shot.  It''s just plain dull.</td>', 'Ok, yeah,  you fit the challenge.  There are a few shadows.  But there is nothing artistic, clever, or thought provoking about this shot.  It''s just plain dull.', '2002-06-19 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75847, 2596, 772, '<td valign="top">As I look at this photo, I am asking myself about these tire tracks in the dirt.  I just bet that you could have made a really cool shadow shot of those tracks close up :)  i like the diagonal shadows in your shot here... good job! - jmsetzler</td>', 'As I look at this photo, I am asking myself about these tire tracks in the dirt.  I just bet that you could have made a really cool shadow shot of those tracks close up :)  i like the diagonal shadows in your shot here... good job! - jmsetzler', '2002-06-19 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75848, 2596, 570, '<td valign="top">this one must have taken hours of planning.</td>', 'this one must have taken hours of planning.', '2002-06-20 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75849, 2596, 1, '<td valign="top">Singling out the dog would have made this a much better shot.</td>', 'Singling out the dog would have made this a much better shot.', '2002-06-23 20:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75850, 2598, 142, '<td valign="top">Where are the shadows?  It is a pretty photo but nothing in it is shadowy to me.</td>', 'Where are the shadows?  It is a pretty photo but nothing in it is shadowy to me.', '2002-06-17 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
