(75852, 2598, 1944, '<td valign="top">A pretty picture. I would have marked it higher if you had controled the exposure a bit more, and the chair back in the foreground doesn''t add to the composition.</td>', 'A pretty picture. I would have marked it higher if you had controled the exposure a bit more, and the chair back in the foreground doesn''t add to the composition.', '2002-06-17 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
