(75904, 2600, 2153, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty and colorful! Maybe would have given a higher score if the other flowers were in better focus! Overall, NICE!</td>', 'This is very pretty and colorful! Maybe would have given a higher score if the other flowers were in better focus! Overall, NICE!', '2002-06-17 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
