(75906, 2600, 1041, '<td valign="top">Those flowers are nice and I like the idea of colorful shadows a lot.  I don''t know what camera you used, so my suggestion may or may not be possible.  Try and increase the DOF, it would be nice to see at least the first flower &amp; bottle, but preferably even more in focus.  Also, have you considered moving the bottles further to the left in the shot to give more of the center stage to the shadows (which are the subject of this challenge after all)?  This would also eliminate the empty space to the left.</td>', 'Those flowers are nice and I like the idea of colorful shadows a lot.  I don''t know what camera you used, so my suggestion may or may not be possible.  Try and increase the DOF, it would be nice to see at least the first flower & bottle, but preferably even more in focus.  Also, have you considered moving the bottles further to the left in the shot to give more of the center stage to the shadows (which are the subject of this challenge after all)?  This would also eliminate the empty space to the left.', '2002-06-18 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75907, 2600, 1054, '<td valign="top">Personally I would have liked more DOF, or a focus on the shadows.</td>', 'Personally I would have liked more DOF, or a focus on the shadows.', '2002-06-18 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75908, 2600, 715, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and how the shadows of every bottle points to a different direction. I think the picture would be more interesting if the bottles would have been positioned more to the left though. <br/></td>', 'I like the colors and how the shadows of every bottle points to a different direction. I think the picture would be more interesting if the bottles would have been positioned more to the left though. ', '2002-06-18 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75909, 2600, 527, '<td valign="top">I think there needs to be a little bit more in focus and longer shadows.</td>', 'I think there needs to be a little bit more in focus and longer shadows.', '2002-06-19 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75910, 2600, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, nice depth of field. Very colourful. The composition is strong and interesting.</td>', 'Very pretty, nice depth of field. Very colourful. The composition is strong and interesting.', '2002-06-19 08:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75911, 2600, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting subjects, but I would have liked seeing more of them.  The first two are O.K., but the other three are too far away and cropped off.  Now, let'' tackle the challenge....Your subject, clearly, is the blue flower in the vase, the shadows feel accidental or incidental.  This challenge didn''t have to be exclusively shadows, but in my opinion, should be a major element or objective.  Photo 9 Creativity 5 Shadows 6 total 7</td>', 'Interesting subjects, but I would have liked seeing more of them.  The first two are O.K., but the other three are too far away and cropped off.  Now, let'' tackle the challenge....Your subject, clearly, is the blue flower in the vase, the shadows feel accidental or incidental.  This challenge didn''t have to be exclusively shadows, but in my opinion, should be a major element or objective.  Photo 9 Creativity 5 Shadows 6 total 7', '2002-06-19 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
