(75933, 2601, 1005, '<td valign="top">You don''t know?  Mostly you have reflected light off the cement, what were you after?  Technically all dark things are shadows of something, so yes, by the strictest interpretation of the word, you have shadows.  I think the idea was to create an image based on the shadow pattern.  Do you see a pattern?  Photo 7 Creativity 4 Shadows 5 total 5</td>', 'You don''t know?  Mostly you have reflected light off the cement, what were you after?  Technically all dark things are shadows of something, so yes, by the strictest interpretation of the word, you have shadows.  I think the idea was to create an image based on the shadow pattern.  Do you see a pattern?  Photo 7 Creativity 4 Shadows 5 total 5', '2002-06-18 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
