(75947, 2602, 1041, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how the shadow vs. sillhouette discussion ended in the forum, but I''m firmly in the ''they are not the same'' camp, so in my mind, you didn''t really meet the challenge.  For a sillhouette shot though, I really like this one.  Interesting shapes, nice contrast, like the white just behind the tower that slowly turns to blue as you get further away.</td>', 'I don''t know how the shadow vs. sillhouette discussion ended in the forum, but I''m firmly in the ''they are not the same'' camp, so in my mind, you didn''t really meet the challenge.  For a sillhouette shot though, I really like this one.  Interesting shapes, nice contrast, like the white just behind the tower that slowly turns to blue as you get further away.', '2002-06-17 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
