(75962, 2602, 312, '<td valign="top">hey marc, to be honest, i''m not the biggest fan of this shot. the halo effect is cool, and the sillhouette is nice, but it''s just a wierd part of the building that doesn''t do much for me. and the angles are all fucked up. heh. and you took this before you got a polarizer, but it could have really benefited from one.</td>', 'hey marc, to be honest, i''m not the biggest fan of this shot. the halo effect is cool, and the sillhouette is nice, but it''s just a wierd part of the building that doesn''t do much for me. and the angles are all fucked up. heh. and you took this before you got a polarizer, but it could have really benefited from one.', '2002-06-24 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(75963, 2602, 313, '<td valign="top">mci - i had just gotten my polarizer when i took this shot.  i''m sorry you don''t like it, but i feel this is one of the best shots i''ve ever done.  i''m not upset about the score so much, because i think it got in the crossfire of the silhouette vs. shadow debate--though i wish it would have done a little better.   i''m also not too upset that it didn''t do so well for reasons you know.  :)  thanks for your comment, though; to everyone else as well for their kind comments.</td>', 'mci - i had just gotten my polarizer when i took this shot.  i''m sorry you don''t like it, but i feel this is one of the best shots i''ve ever done.  i''m not upset about the score so much, because i think it got in the crossfire of the silhouette vs. shadow debate--though i wish it would have done a little better.   i''m also not too upset that it didn''t do so well for reasons you know.  :)  thanks for your comment, though; to everyone else as well for their kind comments.', '2002-06-24 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
